BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0109fe7b-3c0b-4379-b97a-aa53aca21cbc
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee: Science en Cour[t]s meets DiverSE
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \nKicking off this year's DiverSE Coffee with an unusua
 l talk\, if I may call it so! \n\nThe DiverSE ARMY as they call themselves a
 nd mini-DiverSErs as I call them\, would like to participate in a venue spec
 ializing in the vulgarization of Ph.D. students' \nresearch work. Given the 
 DiverS ciplinarity[1] of topics approached by our beloved team members\, the
  DiverSE ARMYiishhh would like to discuss and expose some of their early ide
 as on how to put this down into a 5 minutes short film. \n\nEnters the Marsh
 al\, a.k.a Ludovic Mouline: " \nHello everyone! \n\nEvery year\, a vulgariza
 tion contest is organized by 'Association Nicomaque': Science en Cour[t]s (h
 ttp://sciences-en-courts.fr/). This venue encourages Ph.D. students to disse
 minate and popularize their research work in the form of a short film. Great
 \, right! \n\nEmpowered by June's speech on how to rise from the ashes like 
 a phoenix\, we decided to participate in this event. The idea is simple... m
 aking a short film about the different topics DiverSE works on . \nIn this t
 alk\, I'll introduce "Science en Cour[t]s”. Then I'll showcase a couple of i
 deas we've already discussed. The talk closes up with a discussion and a bra
 instorming. \n\nJUNE WANTS YOU for DiverSE ARMY " \n\nThe discussion is held
  Thursday\, January 31st in room Aurigny at 1 pm. \n\nPermanents\, be aware!
  The Ph.D. students are taking over! I am smelling a coup d'état!!! \n[1] Yo
 u should thank me for the word I just invented! DiverSE+disciplinarity = Div
 erS ciplinarity . Damn\, I am very clever! \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>DiverSE Coffee: Science en Cour[t]s meets DiverSE </td></tr>
 \n<tr><th align=left>Organiser:</th><td>"Amine Benelallam" &lt\;amine.benela
 llam@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th al
 ign=left>Location:</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Aurigny (D165\, Vidéoprojecteur\, V
 isioconférence)" &lt\;rennes-salle_aurigny@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; </td><
 /tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Resources:</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Aurigny (D165\, Vi
 déoprojecteur\, Visioconférence)" &lt\;rennes-salle_aurigny@zimbra-local.inr
 ia.fr&gt\; (Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : D\, Étage : orange\, Salle : D165) </
 td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Time:</th><td>Thursday\, 31 January\, 2019\, 13
 :00:00 - 14:00:00 GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td><
 /tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invitees:</th><td>
 diverse@inria.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><di
