BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:02d90fa9-084a-47bf-a92b-9df868013c43
SUMMARY:Stamp project monthly conf call
DESCRIPTION:Hello everybody !\n\nA reminder of our monthly conf call on next
  Thursday at 10:00 am. :-)\nWe will try Skype this time\, Benoit's skype ID 
 is almyre.\n\nAgenda:\nReview of each work package\n\nIf you want to partici
 pate and you didn't confirm your participation yet\, can you please use the 
 "Accept" button ?\nFor now I only have confirmation from Ilknur\, Malena\, D
 aniele\, Arie and Fernando.\n\nThanks ! :-)\n\nKind Regards\,\nCaroline\n\n\
 n\nCaroline Landry\nSTAMP Project Technical Leader\nDiverSE Research team\nI
 nria Rennes - Bretagne Atlantique\nCampus de Beaulieu - CS 74205\nF-35042 Re
 nnes cedex\, France\n+ 33 (0)2 99 84 75 07\nhttp://www.inria.fr/\n \n-------
 ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ---------------------\n\nHello\, \n\nSorry we have to change the date for th
 is call\, we hope everybody will be able to attend anyway. \n\nKind Regards\
 , \nCaroline
