DESCRIPTION:Hello everyone\,\n\nThe OW2 con'19 will be held in Paris on June
  12-13\, and unfortunately our monthly call is scheduled the same day.\nSo I
 'd like to move this call to the week before\, i.e. on June 6.\n\nThanks for
  your understanding.\n\nKind Regards\,\nCaroline\n\n\n\n--------------------
 ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 -------\n\n\nLa réunion suivante a été modifiée :\n\nSujet : Stamp project m
 onthly conf call \nOrganisateur: "Caroline Landry" <caroline.landry@inria.fr
