 n: UK OFFICIAL\n\n\nClassification: UK OFFICIAL\nDear Anglo-French PhD Super
 visor\,\n\nYou are cordially invited to attend the 7th UK-French PhD Scheme 
 Annual Conference 2019 to be held at the University of Portsmouth on 26-27 J
 une 2019.  Please forward this email to any of your co-supervisors.  Also no
 te that a separate invitation went out to your student a while back\, and th
 at all current students are expected to attend.\nBy accepting this invitatio
 n you will be automatically registered for the conference.\nThe conference w
 ill showcase the research carried out within the UK-French PhD Scheme. It ai
 ms to bring together the UK and French communities\, support exploitation\, 
 and deliver greater understanding of the challenges associated with Defence 
 and Security Science and Technology.\nThere will be poster and oral presenta
 tions from over 30 PhD students in 7 theme areas.  Over 50 academic organisa
 tions from UK and France will be represented.\nProvisional Agenda\n\n\n\nEve
 nt details\nDate: 26-27 June 2019 – starting at 10.00 on 26 June / closing a
 t 12.00 on 27 June\nLocation: University of Portsmouth\, Eldon Building\, Wi
 nston Churchill Avenue\, Portsmouth\, PO1 2DJ\, United Kingdom\nAccommodatio
 n. We have reserved University accommodation\, available at £62 per night th
 at includes continental breakfast.  Rooms are available for the nights of 25
 -27 June.  Booking can be done through the following link:\nhttps://onlinest
 ore.port.ac.uk/conferences-and-events/conference-and-lettings/conferences/ds
 tl-anglo-french-phd-conference-accommodation<https://scanmail.trustwave.com/
 ?c=7369&d=sfnC3K-jOGxXDgjC9XmUsnM36dpmfk3o77G7J-WjMA&u=https%3a%2f%2fonlines
 tore%2eport%2eac%2euk%2fconferences-and-events%2fconference-and-lettings%2fc
 onferences%2fdstl-anglo-french-phd-conference-accommodation>\nNOTE: You need
  to make a reservation latest by Friday 7 June\, after which room availabili
 ty is not guaranteed.\nTravel to Portsmouth\n•       Rail – nearest railway 
 station is Portsmouth and Southsea (about 2-5 mins walk from venue and accom
 modation)\n•       Air – nearest airport is Southampton\n•       Sea – Direc
 t ferry to Portsmouth from Caen/Ouistreham\, Le Harve\, Cherbourg and St Mal
 o.\n•       Road - Winston Churchill Avenue\, Portsmouth\, PO1 2DJ\n\nKind r
 egards\,\n\nLee Goodman\nTDEA Team\nExternal : 01980 956169\nE-mail: lrgoodm
 an@dstl.gov.uk<mailto:lrgoodman@dstl.gov.uk>\n\n\n\n\n\n"This e-mail and any
