SUMMARY:CVL telecon
DESCRIPTION:CVL Joint Submission Team\nBigLever has decided to consider thei
 r position relative to the CVL work before joining our work more. Therefore 
 they will not give a presentation this Monday.\n\n\nCVL Telecon on Webex.\nT
 o preserve my funds it would be good if as many of you as possible used the 
 VoIP option and not the telephone option because I have to pay extra for eve
 ry one calling in.\n\nAgenda:\nTHE FOLLOWING PRESENTATION WILL NOT TAKE PLAC
 E: Presentation of Big Lever and their interest in joining our effort (Charl
 ie or Drew) (10 minutes)\nTCS Initial Submission Q&A (15 minutes)\nMain Feat
 ure: Configurations Units (Ran) (30 minutes)\nConsortium Agreement (Michael)
  (4 minutes)\nNext meeting (1 minute)\n\nSince I have another meeting right 
 after this\, this meeting will end at the top of the hour sharp.\n\n\n\nOyst
 ein Haugen invites you to an online meeting using WebEx.\n\nMeeting Number: 
 846 417 907\nMeeting Password: abrakadabra\n\n------------------------------
 -------------------------\nTo join this meeting (Now from mobile devices!)\n
 -------------------------------------------------------\n1. Go to https://si
 ntef.webex.com/sintef/j.php?J=846417907&PW=NNzkzYjMwNTgz\n2. If requested\, 
 enter your name and email address.\n3. If a password is required\, enter the
  meeting password: abrakadabra\n4. Click "Join".\n5. Follow the instructions
  that appear on your screen.\n\n\n\n----------------------------------------
 ---------------\nAudio conference information\n-----------------------------
 --------------------------\nTo receive a call back\, provide your phone numb
 er when you join the meeting\, or call the number below and enter the access
  code.\nCall-in toll number (UK): (0)20 700 51000\nGlobal call-in numbers: h
 ttps://sintef.webex.com/sintef/globalcallin.php?serviceType=MC&ED=163360437&
 tollFree=0\n\nAccess code:846 417 907\n\nhttp://www.webex.com\n\n\n\nIMPORTA
 NT NOTICE: This WebEx service includes a feature that allows audio and any d
 ocuments and other materials exchanged or viewed during the session to be re
 corded. By joining this session\, you automatically consent to such recordin
 gs. If you do not consent to the recording\, discuss your concerns with the 
 meeting host prior to the start of the recording or do not join the session.
  Please note that any such recordings may be subject to discovery in the eve
 nt of litigation.\n\n
LOCATION:WebEx
