SUMMARY:HEADS Second Period Review
DESCRIPTION:Hello\,\n\nThe date for the HEADS second review is confirmed. It
  will be on the 18/02.\nWe will have *2 full rehearsal days*  on the 16 and 
 17.\n(That means that we all have to travel on the 15/02)\n\nOn the 18/02\, 
 we have to wait for the review agenda to figure out the exact timing but pro
 bably we all have to be present at the EC building until at least 17.00 so d
 o not plan to leave any earlier than that.\n\nIn terms of reviewers\, we hav
 e been informed that Alicia Asín is replaced by Sonja Zwissler\, from IBM Ge
 rmany. Other 2 reviewers are unchanged.\n\nTODO: We have to confirm quickly 
 that we have no conflicts of interest with Sonja Zwissler.\nCan you can chec
 k and come back to us ASAP?\n\nCheers\,\n\nFranck\n\n
