SUMMARY:CVL Submission Team
DESCRIPTION:•       Discussion on whether to submit a revised submission (IB
 M has informed me that they advise against it)\no       This is a very serio
 us change of strategy and I urge especially all submitters to be present to 
 this call!\n•       Action list walk through\n•\n\nOystein Haugen invites yo
 u to an online meeting using WebEx.\n\nMeeting Number: 846 381 441\nMeeting 
 Password: abrakadabra\n\n---------------------------------------------------
 ----\nTo join this meeting (Now from mobile devices!)\n---------------------
 ----------------------------------\n1. Go to https://sintef.webex.com/sintef
 /j.php?J=846381441&PW=NYWYxYWQxODA5\n2. If requested\, enter your name and e
 mail address.\n3. If a password is required\, enter the meeting password: ab
 rakadabra\n4. Click "Join".\n5. Follow the instructions that appear on your 
 screen.\n\n\n\n-------------------------------------------------------\nAudi
