 ke the decision on which the work onwards should build.\n\nThe agenda may ve
 ry well be updated following the consensus between IBM and SINTEF/UiO on a c
 ompromise approach.\n\n\n\n\nOystein Haugen invites you to an online meeting
  using WebEx.\n\nMeeting Number: 847 209 415\nMeeting Password: abrakadabra\
