 209415&PW=NMDIwY2ZkMTQ1\n2. If a password is required\, enter the meeting pa
 ssword: abrakadabra\n3. Click "Join.\n4. Follow the instructions that appear
  on your screen.\n\n\n\n----------------------------------------------------
