DESCRIPTION:NOTE: This telecon is one hour earlier than our usual time since
  Ran and Oystein both had problems with the normal time.\n\nThe call on 5. D
 ecember was very short due to very few participants and conflicting meetings
 . Therefore next week's agenda is just repeated.\n\nAgenda:\n1.      Technic
 al discussion Configurable Units (45 minutes) We take this FIRST this time!\
 n2.      Green reviews?\n3.      Running Example – how common is it? How com
 mon should it be? On variants of the variation model.\n4.      Issues on con
 crete syntax\n5.      Any patent news?\n\n\n\n\n\nOystein Haugen invites you
  to an online meeting using WebEx.\n\nMeeting Number: 847 300 479\nMeeting P
 assword: abrakadabra\n\n----------------------------------------------------
