 j.php?J=847300479&PW=NNWExYTE2MWUw\n2. If requested\, enter your name and em
 ail address.\n3. If a password is required\, enter the meeting password: abr
 akadabra\n4. Click "Join".\n5. Follow the instructions that appear on your s
 creen.\n\n\n\n-------------------------------------------------------\nAudio
