 ted\, enter your name and email address.\n3. If a password is required\, ent
 er the meeting password: abrakadabra\n4. Click "Join".\n5. Follow the instru
 ctions that appear on your screen.\n\n\n\n----------------------------------
 ---------------------\nAudio conference information\n-----------------------
 --------------------------------\nTo receive a call back\, provide your phon
 e number when you join the meeting\, or call the number below and enter the 
