 above\n\n-          Eindhoven: plans the next call on the topic of digital e
 ngineering => paper => proposal\n\n-          Rennes: inquires how Eclipse p
 lans to coordinate the actions on digital twins\n\n-          NN: look at Mi
 ndSphere\, Azure\, etc. to better understand these digital twin platforms\n\
 nBest regards\,\nManuela\n\n[1] https://docs.google.com/document/d/16fusN8x_
 2_UKXW2XptQ-R1HpBew2xeWPTqkw82E17kc/edit?usp=sharing\n\n\n[https://d24cgw3uv
 b9a9h.cloudfront.net/static/94064/image/new/ZoomLogo_110_25.png]<https://zoo
 m.us/>\n\nHallo\,\n\nManuela Dalibor lädt Sie zu einem geplanten Zoom Meetin
