SUMMARY:CVL Submission Team
DESCRIPTION:Dear CVL-ers\nTime for picking up CVL again.\n\n•       Summary 
 of status CVL\no       Status OMG\no       Status Big Lever\n•       CVL XMI
 \no       I am suggesting IBM takes care of this :-)\n•       CVL Diagram De
 finition\no       I am willing to look into this with help from IBM (Maged E
 laasar)\n•       Contracts and agreements\no       Work on consortium agreem
 ent?\n•       FTF and OMG members\no       How to include our most valuable 
 academic consortium members?\n•       AOB\n\n\n\n\nOystein Haugen invites yo
 u to an online meeting using WebEx.\n\nMeeting Number: 846 854 061\nMeeting 
 Password: abrakadabra\n\n---------------------------------------------------
 ----\nTo join this meeting (Now from mobile devices!)\n---------------------
 ----------------------------------\n1. Go to https://sintef.webex.com/sintef
 /j.php?J=846854061&PW=NMmI5MzZkOWQz\n2. If requested\, enter your name and e
 mail address.\n3. If a password is required\, enter the meeting password: ab
 rakadabra\n4. Click "Join".\n5. Follow the instructions that appear on your 
 screen.\n\n\n\n-------------------------------------------------------\nAudi
 o conference information\n--------------------------------------------------
 -----\nTo receive a call back\, provide your phone number when you join the 
 meeting\, or call the number below and enter the access code.\nCall-in toll 
 number (UK): +44-20-310-64804\nGlobal call-in numbers: https://sintef.webex.
 com/sintef/globalcallin.php?serviceType=MC&ED=206538827&tollFree=0\n\nAccess
  code:846 854 061\n\nhttp://www.webex.com\n\n\n\nIMPORTANT NOTICE: This WebE
 x service includes a feature that allows audio and any documents and other m
 aterials exchanged or viewed during the session to be recorded. By joining t
 his session\, you automatically consent to such recordings. If you do not co
 nsent to the recording\, discuss your concerns with the meeting host prior t
 o the start of the recording or do not join the session. Please note that an
 y such recordings may be subject to discovery in the event of litigation.\n\
 n
LOCATION:WebEx
