 10000000A1452E3901094D488B6988C378E1A194
SUMMARY:[EASY2] Proposal phone meeting #2
DESCRIPTION:Hello\,\n\nWe will have a phone meeting tomorrow at 14.00 to dis
 cuss the progress of the EASY2 proposal.\n\nTasks: Please make sure you have
  completed the "Contractor's Details"\, "Contractor's Key Personnel"\, " Con
 tractor's Financial Information" in EMDESK (you will get new tasks tomorrow 
 so don't be behind on these first tasks).\nAlso remember to book your travel
  for next week's meeting in Oslo.\n\nConsortium: Software AG has joined the 
 consortium as a technology provider. Ongoing discussions with ATC to join as
  a 3rd use case provider.\n\nMeeting Agenda: WP structure\, role of the part
 ners\, project general objectives\, WP responsibilities.\n\nI can see in the
  Doodle poll that Software AG will not be able to attend at 14.00.\nWalter: 
 Can we have a separate chat at 15.00? I can go through the proposal in more 
 details since you just joined. We can use the same meeting facility.\n\nFor 
 others who have not indicated their availabilities we can have separate indi
 vidual meetings if you cannot attend tomorrow at 14.00. Just let me know you
 r availabilities.\n\nThe link to join the meeting is at the end of this emai
 l.\n\nCheers\,\n\nFranck\n\n\nMeeting invitation:\n****************\n1.  Ple
 ase join my meeting.\nhttps://www2.gotomeeting.com/join/593333138\n\n2.  Use
  your microphone and speakers (VoIP) - a headset is recommended.  Or\, call 
 in using your telephone.\n\nDial +1 (312) 878-3080\nAccess Code: 593-333-138
 \nAudio PIN: Shown after joining the meeting\n\nMeeting ID: 593-333-138\n\nG
 oToMeeting®\nOnline Meetings Made Easy™\n\nNot at your computer? Click the l
 ink to join this meeting from your iPhone®\, iPad® or Android® device via th
 e GoToMeeting app.\n\n
LOCATION:Gotomeeting
