 :15:00\n\nIntroduction\n\nJulie Byrne\, Jean Luc Beylat (Nokia)\nFrancois Cu
 ny (Inria)\n\n10:15 AM\n\n00:40:00\n\nkeynote " Some thoughts on\nMachine le
 arning  for Communications"\n\nJakob Hoydis\, Nokia\n\nK1\n\n\nSession 1: An
 alytics and machine learning for mobile networks\n\n10:55 AM\n\n00:10:00\n\n
 Summary of common lab research on End-to-End Autonomic Network based data an
 alytics and Machine Learning\n\nAbdelakader Outtagarts\, Nokia\n\nS1.1\n\n11
