 100000005EB26041C38DF94899FE223A05795956
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;UNTIL=20140131T123000Z;INTERVAL=1;BYDAY=MO
SUMMARY:HEADS weekly telco
DESCRIPTION:Dear all\,\n\nThis is an invitation for the weekly technical HEA
 DS telco. It will be every Monday at 13:30 (Oslo time\, remember to adjust t
 o your local time) and should last for 30 minutes\, though I planned it for 
 one hour\, just in case we need some more time sometimes. After M4\, we migh
 t have this telco every second week\, only.\n\nWe will use Google Hangouts a
 nd stick with it if it works. If not\, I will setup a GoTo meeting.\n\nUnles
 s specified otherwise\, the agenda for these telcos will be:\n-       Follow
 -up of due and upcoming action items\n-       Follow-up of deliverables due 
 in the next 6 months\n\nWP and task leaders should prepare a 2-slides presen
 tation on their on-going deliverables (due within the next 6 months) reporti
 ng on:\n-       What is been done and not done according to the action items
  agreed during the previous telcos\n-       What remains to be done i.e.\, n
 ew/revised action items to deliver in due time\n\nBest regards\,\n\n\n--\nDr
 . Brice Morin<http://brice-morin.info/>\, Research Scientist\nSINTEF ICT\, O
 slo\, Norway\nBrice.Morin@sintef.no<mailto:Brice.Morin@sintef.no>\n+47 22067
 663\n\n\n\n\n
LOCATION:Google Hangouts
