SUMMARY:PHD Student for SAP Research- F/M
DESCRIPTION:Dear all\,\n\nI have to postpone the meeting by 30min\, let us p
 lease start at 10h.\n\nThe last 30 min are anyways a buffer only – I do not 
 think we need them.\n\nLooking forward to speaking you tomorrow\,\nKind rega
 rds\, Henrik\n--\nDear all\,\n\nAfter having discussed with Amine a few week
 s back\, this second interview is meant to introduce him to the scientific s
 upervisors at the University of Rennes. Moreover\, we have prepared a couple
  of exercises.\n\nEven though he lives in Rennes\, the measures of the Frenc
 h government regarding the Covid-19 crisis make a face-to-face meeting at th
 e University impossible.\n\nI have setup the meeting with MS Teams- I believ
 e its browser application supports screensharing such that we can follow and
  discuss the exercises.\n\nKind regards\,\nHenrik\n_________________________
 _______________________________________________________\nJoin Microsoft Team
 s Meeting<https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_Zjc1OGExNDE
