 ession to be recorded. By joining this session\, you automatically consent t
 o such recordings. If you do not consent to the recording\, discuss your con
 cerns with the meeting host prior to the start of the recording or do not jo
 in the session. Please note that any such recordings may be subject to disco
 very in the event of litigation.\n\n
