  decline toute responsabilite si ce message a ete altere\, deforme ou falsif
 ie. Merci.\n\nThis message and its attachments may contain confidential or p
 rivileged information that may be protected by law\;\nthey should not be dis
 tributed\, used or copied without authorisation.\nIf you have received this 
 email in error\, please notify the sender and delete this message and its at
 tachments.\nAs emails may be altered\, Orange is not liable for messages tha
 t have been modified\, changed or falsified.\nThank you.\n\n
