  9 somewhat more compact (Joao)\no       Improving Chapter 8 such that it be
 comes more clear what it is meant to be (Krzysztof\, Kacper)\no       Produc
 tion of Manual – execute to make sure the program works (Michael)\no       N
 ew chapter on concrete syntax – with no inventions\, but to summarize our si
 tuation (Øystein)\n•       On the submission of the revised submission – the
