 100000007FE53307CB629F4C9C4F21E149F5A02A
SUMMARY:GoToMeeting Invitation - ENACT Advisory Board meeting follow up
DESCRIPTION:Hello!\n\nThis is a kind reminder of the meeting we have schedul
 ed for 4pm today\, with a very simple agenda below. The idea is to continue 
 the discussions we were having in Bilbao – we planed for a session with feed
 backs for the whole project\, but didn't have time to go through this. We wi
 ll also take some time to discuss how we follow up the Advisory Board in the
  rest of the project.\n\nSince it's Friday afternoon (morning)\, we will try
  to keep this as short as possible (depending on the number of comments\, of
  course😊)\n\nTalk to you soon!\n\nBest regards\,\nHui\n\n\n\nAgenda\n\n·   
      Status\n\no   Bilbao meeting\n\no   Reimbursement\n\n·        Global co
 mments and discussion based on the Bilbao meeting\n\no   Technologies\n\no  
  Presentations\n\no   Next steps\n\n·        Next steps of the Advisory Boar
 d\n\no   Content and forms\n\n\n\n\n\nENACT Advisory Board meeting follow up
 \nFri\, Apr 26\, 2019 4:00 PM - 5:00 PM CEST\n\nPlease join my meeting from 
 your computer\, tablet or smartphone.\nhttps://global.gotomeeting.com/join/7
 50572517\n\n\nYou can also dial in using your phone.\n(For supported devices
 \, tap a one-touch number below to join instantly.)\n\nDenmark: +45 32 72 03
  82\n- One-touch: tel:+4532720382\,\,750572517#<tel:+4532720382\,\,750572517
 >\n\nAccess Code: 750-572-517\n\n\nMore phone numbers:\n(For supported devic
 es\, tap a one-touch number below to join instantly.)\n\nFrance: +33 170 950
