 eature: Example to be used for ConfigurableUnits (revisit Initial Submission
 ) (responsible: Ran\, Oystein\, Carmen)\n-       More progress on Configurab
 leUnits metamodel would also be welcomed\, but we need to find intuitive exa
 mples on which we apply the metamodel.\n-       Hopefully we should be able 
 to use tools to produce repositories\, but before that we should at least in
 dicate how the repositories would be structured. I know this is a pain in th
 e neck to do\, but doing it always turns out fruitful.\n-\n-\n-\n-       Oys
 tein Haugen invites you to an online meeting using WebEx.\n-\n-       Meetin
 g Number: 846 480 800\n-       Meeting Password: abrakadabra\n-\n-       ---
 ----------------------------------------------------\n-       To join this m
 eeting (Now from mobile devices!)\n-       ---------------------------------
