SUMMARY:CVL Joint Submission Team
DESCRIPTION:Decisions:\nA.      Physical Meeting: Berlin 11.-12. July\nB.   
    Cooperation platform: GoogleDocs\, GoogleCloud\, Word+SVN with lock\, ...
 \n\nMain feature: Concrete Syntax (presentation: Oystein)\nPlease make prese
 ntations available on the SVN prior to the presentation for better feedback.
 \n\nAny other business?\n\n\n\nOystein Haugen invites you to an online meeti
 ng using WebEx.\n\nMeeting Number: 849 856 581\nMeeting Password: abrakadabr
 a\n\n-------------------------------------------------------\nTo join this m
 eeting (Now from mobile devices!)\n-----------------------------------------
 --------------\n1. Go to https://sintef.webex.com/sintef/j.php?J=849856581&P
 W=NMDI3NWM1MTZh\n2. If requested\, enter your name and email address.\n3. If
  a password is required\, enter the meeting password: abrakadabra\n4. Click 
 "Join".\n5. Follow the instructions that appear on your screen.\n\n\n\n-----
 --------------------------------------------------\nAudio conference informa
 tion\n-------------------------------------------------------\nTo receive a 
 call back\, provide your phone number when you join the meeting\, or call th
 e number below and enter the access code.\nCall-in toll number (UK): (0)20 7
 00 51000\nGlobal call-in numbers: https://sintef.webex.com/sintef/globalcall
 in.php?serviceType=MC&ED=165020292&tollFree=0\n\nAccess code:849 856 581\n\n
 http://www.webex.com\n\n\n\nIMPORTANT NOTICE: This WebEx service includes a 
 feature that allows audio and any documents and other materials exchanged or
  viewed during the session to be recorded. By joining this session\, you aut
 omatically consent to such recordings. If you do not consent to the recordin
 g\, discuss your concerns with the meeting host prior to the start of the re
 cording or do not join the session. Please note that any such recordings may
  be subject to discovery in the event of litigation.\n\n
LOCATION:WebEx
