RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;UNTIL=20160213T113000Z;INTERVAL=1;BYDAY=FR
SUMMARY:HEADS: Weekly status meetings before the review
DESCRIPTION:Dear all\n\nAs agreed in the meeting last week we will have a we
 ekly status update where we will discuss actions and issues with respect to 
 our review preparations. Link to meeting:\nhttps://plus.google.com/hangouts/
 _/event/c1tqr7tonv1cm75ppd9rofhd1j8?authuser=0&hl=en\n\nThe set of action po
 ints we agreed last week is as follows:\n(BTW: The minutes of the meeting la
 st week is uploaded in the eRoom here: https://project.sintef.no/eRoom/ikt/H
 EADS/0_8f903)\n\n\n        Who     Subject When\nAP48    ATC\, Ilias (All)  
       Web site to be updated  January 18\nAP47    Olivier\, with Franck and 
 Arnor  Overall HEADS IDE picture\nATC to refine design (January 25)       Ja
 nuary 20\nAP46    Olivier/Maxime  HEADS IDE Download counter      January 20
 \nAP45    All     D7.3 inputs (text input + PM inputs)\nMissing from INRIA\,
  Tellu\, ATC  14.01.16\nAP44    All     D7.3 Cost figures and NEF       ASAP
 \, February 1\nAP43    All     Presentations for the review\, version 0.9 co
 nsolidation February 8\nAP42    All     Presentations for the review\, final
  version for rehearsal       February 15\nAP41    Martin\, Ilias\, All      
 List of exploitable artifacts and joint exploitations\, with the interested 
 partners and roles/ownerships        February 1\nAP40    All     Presentatio
 ns of individual exploitation including the BMC template     January 22\nAP3
 9    Knut Eilif\, Steffen\, Anders\, Olivier\, Maxime    Demonstration imple
 mentations\, including the appearance of the fall detection sensor component
  in the HEADS IDE February 10\nAP38    Ilias   Publication plan        Janua
 ry 14\nAP37    Nicolas\, and Manuel     Exploiting the GitHub figures for th
 e explotation presentation  February 1\nAP36    Arnor   Review accomodation 
     January 22\nAP35    Olivier\, Arnor to check Two beamers\, and network c
 onditions. Knut Eilif will bring a 4G modem   January 20\nAP34    Franck\, I
 lias\, Arnor    How to present the evaluation and also the KPIs January 22\n
 AP33    All     Follow up the action points specified in the notes above!   
     Various dates\nAP32    (Olivier)       Get the counter of downloads up a
 nd running\nCheck the access log for predicting the downloads\n        Tonig
 ht (Dec 8)\n\n\n\n
LOCATION:Google Hagnouts
