SUMMARY:CVL Submission Team
DESCRIPTION:Agenda:\n1.      Technical discussion Configurable Units (45 min
 utes) We take this FIRST this time!\n2.      Green reviews?\n3.      Running
  Example – how common is it? How common should it be? On variants of the var
 iation model.\n4.      Issues on concrete syntax\n5.      Any patent news?\n
 \nThis meeting is extended to 1.5 hours in order to cover more grounds.\n\n/
 Oystein\n\n\nOystein Haugen invites you to an online meeting using WebEx.\n\
 nMeeting Number: 841 322 554\nMeeting Password: abrakadabra\n\n-------------
 ------------------------------------------\nTo join this meeting (Now from m
 obile devices!)\n-------------------------------------------------------\n1.
  Go to https://sintef.webex.com/sintef/j.php?J=841322554&PW=NZGEzMzI4Y2Fj\n2
 . If requested\, enter your name and email address.\n3. If a password is req
 uired\, enter the meeting password: abrakadabra\n4. Click "Join".\n5. Follow
  the instructions that appear on your screen.\n\n\n\n-----------------------
 --------------------------------\nAudio conference information\n------------
 -------------------------------------------\nTo receive a call back\, provid
 e your phone number when you join the meeting\, or call the number below and
  enter the access code.\nCall-in toll number (UK): +44-20-310-64804\nGlobal 
 call-in numbers: https://sintef.webex.com/sintef/globalcallin.php?serviceTyp
 e=MC&ED=185391167&tollFree=0\n\nAccess code:841 322 554\n\nhttp://www.webex.
 com\n\n\n\nIMPORTANT NOTICE: This WebEx service includes a feature that allo
 ws audio and any documents and other materials exchanged or viewed during th
 e session to be recorded. By joining this session\, you automatically consen
 t to such recordings. If you do not consent to the recording\, discuss your 
 concerns with the meeting host prior to the start of the recording or do not
  join the session. Please note that any such recordings may be subject to di
 scovery in the event of litigation.\n\n
