 are your availability.\n\n\n\nLooking forward to speaking to you\,\n\nKind r
 egards\, Henrik Plate\n\n---\n\nHenrik Plate\n\nSenior Researcher\n\nSAP Pro
 duct Security Research\n\nSAP Labs France\, 805 Av. Maurice Donat\, F-06250 
