 /c1tqr7tonv1cm75ppd9rofhd1j8?authuser=0&hl=en\n\nIlias: Can you make sure th
 at those meetings are put in the eroom Calendar and with some very short min
 utes?\n\nOlivier will provide a demo for the doker-manager (https://github.c
 om/ahervieu/docker-manager)\n\nKostas will provide some technical details ov
 er the ATC cases. What are the different platforms involved. Which languages
 \, libraries\, middlwares\, etc will be used for the case.\n\nCheers\,\n\nFr
 anck\n\n
