DESCRIPTION:Dear all\,\n\nThank you to those who filled in the Doodle poll. 
 The telco will be held on Monday 7th October\, 14:00-15:00 (Oslo time\, make
  sure you adjust the time to your local time)\, as it maximizes the number o
 f partners able to attend.\n\nIt is recommended you use VoIP (using a headse
 t connected to your PC)\, but I also joined some local phone numbers (unfort
 unately\, we do not have a number for Greece).\n\nYou will find below the in
 formation to access the virtual meeting room.\n\nBest regards\,\n\nBrice.\n\
 n1.  Please join my meeting.\nhttps://www2.gotomeeting.com/join/448759458\n\
 n2.  Use your microphone and speakers (VoIP) - a headset is recommended.  Or
 \, call in using your telephone.\n\nNorway: +47 21 04 29 12\nFrance: +33 (0)
  182 880 159\nGermany: +49 (0) 811 8899 6925\nIreland: +353 (0) 14 845 982\n
 United Kingdom: +44 20 3657 6776\n\nAccess Code: 448-759-458\nAudio PIN: Sho
 wn after joining the meeting\n\nMeeting ID: 448-759-458\n\nGoToMeeting®\nOnl
 ine Meetings Made Easy®\n\nNot at your computer? Click the link to join this
  meeting from your iPhone®\, iPad® or Android® device via the GoToMeeting ap
 p.\n\n
