SUMMARY:CVL Submission Team
DESCRIPTION:Dear all\nThis update is because it seems that I forgot to inclu
 de the WebEx info :-(\n\n•       Derived features\n•       Continue maturing
  the discussion on alternatives of publicizing CVL\n\n\n\n\n\nOystein Haugen
  invites you to an online meeting using WebEx.\n\nMeeting Number: 849 591 68
 6\nMeeting Password: abrakadabra\n\n----------------------------------------
 ---------------\nTo join this meeting (Now from mobile devices!)\n----------
 ---------------------------------------------\n1. Go to https://sintef.webex
 .com/sintef/j.php?J=849591686&PW=NMTdmODA4N2Q5\n2. If requested\, enter your
  name and email address.\n3. If a password is required\, enter the meeting p
 assword: abrakadabra\n4. Click "Join".\n5. Follow the instructions that appe
 ar on your screen.\n\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------
 -----\nAudio conference information\n---------------------------------------
 ----------------\nTo receive a call back\, provide your phone number when yo
 u join the meeting\, or call the number below and enter the access code.\nCa
 ll-in toll number (UK): +44-20-310-64804\nGlobal call-in numbers: https://si
 ntef.webex.com/sintef/globalcallin.php?serviceType=MC&ED=198731352&tollFree=
 0\n\nAccess code:849 591 686\n\nhttp://www.webex.com\n\n\n\nIMPORTANT NOTICE
 : This WebEx service includes a feature that allows audio and any documents 
 and other materials exchanged or viewed during the session to be recorded. B
 y joining this session\, you automatically consent to such recordings. If yo
 u do not consent to the recording\, discuss your concerns with the meeting h
 ost prior to the start of the recording or do not join the session. Please n
 ote that any such recordings may be subject to discovery in the event of lit
 igation.\n\n
