 etworking\no       Ludovic Noirie (ALU):  Softwarization of Internet of Thin
 gs and Smart Environments: SDN\, IoT and big data combined\no       Olivier 
 Barais (Inria): Models@Runtime for Software Defined Networks\no       Catali
 n Hritcu and Karthikeyan Bhargavan  (Inria): More Secure Software Systems by
  Formal Verification\, Property-Based Testing\, Secure Compilation\, and Dyn
 amic Monitoring\n-       Pause 15’\n-       Brainstorming: Priorities to be 
