SUMMARY:CVL Submission Team
DESCRIPTION:NOTE STILL EARLY TIME.\n\nAgenda:\n•       Report from Krzysztof
  on his editing work\n•       Discussion on Configurable Units\n\nAction Poi
 nts\nWho     What    When\nAndrzej Iteration Constraints Sections 7.3 and 8.
 3      Thu 26 January\nSouvik  Iteration Opaque VP Sections 7.4.x + 8.4.x   
    Thu 26 January\nKrzysztof       Editing 7&8 for understandability       M
 on 30 January (first checkpoint)\nMichael Add new person from INRIA to cvlom
 g-list\, and remove Marie eventually   1 February\nAll     Essential that ev
 erybody reads up on Configurable Units and the associated metamodel!   Monda
 y 30 January 14:00 next telecon\n\n\n\nOystein Haugen invites you to an onli
 ne meeting using WebEx.\n\nMeeting Number: 848 821 824\nMeeting Password: ab
 rakadabra\n\n-------------------------------------------------------\nTo joi
 n this meeting (Now from mobile devices!)\n---------------------------------
 ----------------------\n1. Go to https://sintef.webex.com/sintef/j.php?J=848
 821824&PW=NM2U5MGUzMzQ3\n2. If requested\, enter your name and email address
 .\n3. If a password is required\, enter the meeting password: abrakadabra\n4
 . Click "Join".\n5. Follow the instructions that appear on your screen.\n\n\
 n\n-------------------------------------------------------\nAudio conference
  information\n-------------------------------------------------------\nTo re
 ceive a call back\, provide your phone number when you join the meeting\, or
  call the number below and enter the access code.\nCall-in toll number (UK):
  +44-20-310-64804\nGlobal call-in numbers: https://sintef.webex.com/sintef/g
 lobalcallin.php?serviceType=MC&ED=196965337&tollFree=0\n\nAccess code:848 82
 1 824\n\nhttp://www.webex.com\n\n\n\nIMPORTANT NOTICE: This WebEx service in
 cludes a feature that allows audio and any documents and other materials exc
 hanged or viewed during the session to be recorded. By joining this session\
 , you automatically consent to such recordings. If you do not consent to the
  recording\, discuss your concerns with the meeting host prior to the start 
 of the recording or do not join the session. Please note that any such recor
 dings may be subject to discovery in the event of litigation.\n\n
LOCATION:WebEx
