SUMMARY:[EASY] Proposal status meeting
DESCRIPTION:Hello\,\n\nThanks for answering the doodle poll. We will have th
 e next phone meeting on Thursday from 3PM to 4PM (CET Time).\n\nBy then it w
 ould be good for everyone to have an initial version for the input templates
  we have provided.\nFor those who have already provided some text I have put
  some comments directly in the documents.\n\nAlso\, I am missing cost figure
 s from ISA and Siemens to prepare the initial budget. All I need is 2 number
 s for the PM rate: personnel cost and indirect cost.\nIt is not a problem if
  these number are not exact to the euro. They can be adjusted later but I re
 ally need some numbers to start budgeting the project.\n\nIf you need any su
 pport for filling out the template please do not wait until the meeting and 
 contact me. We can have separate phone conferences before Thursday if needed
 .\n\nInformation to join the phone meeting is included bellow.\n\nCheers\,\n
 \nFranck\n\n1.  Please join my meeting.\nhttps://www2.gotomeeting.com/join/4
 35738458\n\n2.  Use your microphone and speakers (VoIP) - a headset is recom
 mended.  Or\, call in using your telephone.\n\nDial +1 (630) 869-1010\nAcces
 s Code: 435-738-458\nAudio PIN: Shown after joining the meeting\n\nMeeting I
 D: 435-738-458\n\nGoToMeeting®\nOnline Meetings Made Easy™\n\n
