UID:040000008200E00074C5B7101A82E00800000000E0DC568A8D1FCC010000000000000000
 10000000D77E7C4C6BC6D94B984B9F1C013C54DF
SUMMARY:CVL Submission Team (usual time)
DESCRIPTION:We will continue with concrete syntax reviewing the contribution
 s (I point to some people to come up with suggestions/examples):\n(Unfortuna
 tely Ran will not be present in this meeting\, but I do hope he contributes 
 before it as usual.)\n-       Configurable Units: Ran wanted adornments on b
 ase language\; Jean-Marc wanted a default (textual?) way.\n-       VSpec dia
 grams: Øystein to elaborate on example\; Jean-Marc suggested a textual defau
 lt.\n-       Variation Points (realization layer): Ran suggested simple depe
 ndencies on base model\; Øystein suggested highlighting on base\; Other sugg
 estions?\n-       Resolution model: Carmen to give suggestion/example based 
 on PLUM approach\n\nAs for our approach in general to the concrete syntax th
 e following arguments were voiced:\n-       We should have a clear default s
 uggestion\n-       We should have possibilities to configure the concrete sy
 ntax\n-       We should collect experiences with concrete syntax before fixi
 ng the syntax\nIn my opinion these opinion are to a reasonable extent consis
 tent. We will provide a default concrete syntax that we use in our own examp
 les in the Revised Submission. We also device ways to explain how the concre
 te syntax should be configurable.\n\n\n\n\nOystein Haugen invites you to an 
 online meeting using WebEx.\n\nMeeting Number: 840 905 499\nMeeting Password
 : abrakadabra\n\n-------------------------------------------------------\nTo
  join this meeting (Now from mobile devices!)\n-----------------------------
 --------------------------\n1. Go to https://sintef.webex.com/sintef/j.php?J
 =840905499&PW=NZDQzZTFlM2Uy\n2. If requested\, enter your name and email add
 ress.\n3. If a password is required\, enter the meeting password: abrakadabr
 a\n4. Click "Join".\n5. Follow the instructions that appear on your screen.\
 n\n\n\n-------------------------------------------------------\nAudio confer
 ence information\n-------------------------------------------------------\nT
 o receive a call back\, provide your phone number when you join the meeting\
 , or call the number below and enter the access code.\nCall-in toll number (
 UK): (0)20 700 51000\nGlobal call-in numbers: https://sintef.webex.com/sinte
 f/globalcallin.php?serviceType=MC&ED=167589107&tollFree=0\n\nAccess code:840
  905 499\n\nhttp://www.webex.com\n\n\n\nIMPORTANT NOTICE: This WebEx service
  includes a feature that allows audio and any documents and other materials 
 exchanged or viewed during the session to be recorded. By joining this sessi
 on\, you automatically consent to such recordings. If you do not consent to 
 the recording\, discuss your concerns with the meeting host prior to the sta
 rt of the recording or do not join the session. Please note that any such re
 cordings may be subject to discovery in the event of litigation.\n\n
LOCATION:WebEx
