SUMMARY:GoToMeeting Invitation - iThing Proposal (Franck until 11.30)
DESCRIPTION:Hello again\,\n\nThanks for filling out the doodle poll.\nUnfort
 unately there is no time slot in which everyone is available. But there are 
 two adjacent slots which could work.\nI propose that we do the phone meeting
  on Wednesday from 10.30 to 11.30 (CET time).\nEamonn will have to leave the
  meeting early and Johann and Julie will join a bit late but that should be 
 ok.\n\nWe will do the meeting using GoToMeeting\, see the info bellow.\n\nCh
 eers\,\n\nFranck\n\n\n1.  Please join my meeting.\nhttps://www2.gotomeeting.
 com/join/117296202\n\n2.  Use your microphone and speakers (VoIP) - a headse
 t is recommended.  Or\, call in using your telephone.\n\nDial +1 (636) 277-0
 137\nAccess Code: 117-296-202\nAudio PIN: Shown after joining the meeting\n\
 nMeeting ID: 117-296-202\n\nGoToMeeting®\nOnline Meetings Made Easy™\n\n
