SUMMARY:INRIA Bell labs common lab phase III
DESCRIPTION:Dear all\n\nHere is the agenda we are proposing :\n\n15:00-15h10
  Introduction\n\nNext presentation from each working group: 15 min presentat
 ions + 10 min questions / discussions\n\n15h10-15h35 WG Analytics/big data/ 
 deep learning\n15h35-16h00 WG Verification tools\n16h00-16h25 WG Security\n1
 6h25-16h50     WG IoT and smart environments\n16h50-17h15 WG Management  of 
 complex and dynamic distributed systems\n17h15-17h40 WG Connectionless netwo
 rks for IoT\n\n17h40-18h00 Wrap ups - next steps\n\nThank you to each WG to 
 confirm if they will be able to do a presentation (objectives\, scientific c
 hallenges\, industrial stakes\, teams which could be involved) and to send m
 e the slides by March 9 afternoon.\n\nBest regards\n\nOlivier.\n\n
