 he FTF\n•       The future of CVL\n\nPlease give priority to this telecon.\n
 \n/Øystein\n\n\n\n\nOystein Haugen invites you to an online meeting using We
 bEx.\n\nMeeting Number: 849 668 788\nMeeting Password: abrakadabra\n\n------
 -------------------------------------------------\nTo join this meeting (Now
  from mobile devices!)\n----------------------------------------------------
 ---\n1. Go to https://sintef.webex.com/sintef/j.php?J=849668788&PW=NMWJiOTFk
 YzU5\n2. If requested\, enter your name and email address.\n3. If a password
  is required\, enter the meeting password: abrakadabra\n4. Click "Join".\n5.
  Follow the instructions that appear on your screen.\n\n\n\n----------------
 ---------------------------------------\nAudio conference information\n-----
 --------------------------------------------------\nTo receive a call back\,
  provide your phone number when you join the meeting\, or call the number be
