    *   your feedback\n\n   *   stronger synthesis\n\n   *   obstacles for a 
 model-based DevOps for Industry 4.0\n\n   *   “overview” instead of “state-o
 f-the-art”\n\n   *   companion website (representation as two or one studies
 ?) https://github.com/awortmann/gemoc.github.io/blob/gh-pages-edit/modeling4
 Industry4.0/index.md\n\n   *   next steps\n\n\n\nBest\,\n\nAndreas\n
