BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:068065b3-23e2-4031-bd3b-efae707d2021
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee [Olivier Barais]: Hands on the DiverSE website
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nBring your laptop and join the band! \n\nOlivier Ba
 rais\, CEO/CTO of DiverSE Inc. & Co. will be giving a tutorial on how to use
  your mouse\, keyboard\, and internet connexion to update your profile in th
 e DiverSE portal. \n\nAll jokes aside\, Olivier will be presenting the new D
 iverSE portal. How it works and how to contribute to it. Following\, a hands
 -on session where all the team members will be updating their profiles. This
  is expected to grant more visibility to the team itself as well as the team
  members. \n\nAs YOU need the DiverSE portal\, the DiverSE portal needs YOU 
 too! \nWe'd be very glad having some volunteers coming forward for taking th
 e responsibility for the maintenance of the DiverSE portal. The reward will 
 be disclosed after the nomination. You'll be surprised how amazing it is! \n
 \nThe presentation is held in Lipari at 1 pm. Please DO NOT forget to bring 
 your laptop. \n\nKind regards\, \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>DiverSE Coffee [Olivier Barais]: Hands on the DiverSE websit
 e </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organiser:</th><td>"Amine Benelallam" &lt\;
 amine.benelallam@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>
 \n<tr><th align=left>Location:</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202 Vidéoproje
 cteur\, Visioconférence)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\
 ; </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Resources:</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F2
 02 Vidéoprojecteur\, Visioconférence)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local
 .inria.fr&gt\; (Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : orange\, Salle : F202
 ) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Time:</th><td>Thursday\, 22 November\, 2018
 \, 13:00:00 - 13:30:00 GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n <
 /td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invitees:</th
 ><td>diverse@inria.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><b
 r><div style="font-family: arial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\
 ; color: #000000"><div><div>Hi all\,&nbsp\;</div><div><br></div><div>Bring y
 our laptop and join the band!&nbsp\;</div><div><br></div><div>Olivier Barais
 \, CEO/CTO of DiverSE Inc. &amp\; Co. will be giving a tutorial on how to us
 e your mouse\, keyboard\, and internet connexion to update your profile in t
 he DiverSE portal.&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</div><div><br></div><div>All jokes aside\,
  Olivier will be presenting the new DiverSE portal. How it works and how to 
 contribute to it. Following\, a hands-on session where all the team members 
 will be updating their profiles. This is expected to grant more visibility t
 o the team itself as well as the team members.</div><div><br></div><div>As&n
 bsp\;YOU need the DiverSE portal\, the DiverSE portal needs YOU too!&nbsp\;<
 /div><div>We'd be very glad having some volunteers coming forward for taking
  the responsibility for the maintenance of the DiverSE portal. The reward wi
 ll be disclosed after the nomination. You'll be surprised how amazing it is!
 &nbsp\;</div><div><br></div><div>The presentation is held in Lipari at 1 pm.
  Please DO NOT forget to bring your laptop.</div><div><br></div><div>Kind re
 gards\,&nbsp\;</div></div></div></body></html>
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202 Vidéoprojecteur\, Visioconférence)" <ren
 nes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
