BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0997ca95-6f49-46e6-a0c1-19757bc2d4cb
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee [ENZO Menegaldo]: Analysis of trade-offs between prec
 ision and energy consumption in mobile app development
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nWe're happy to announce our next DiverSE Coffee fea
 turing  Enzo Menegaldo.\n\nEnzo is an intern working on the analysis of trad
 e-offs between precision and energy consumption in mobile apps' development 
 as part of the PROFILE project.\n\nEnters Enzo:\n"As I will leave you at the
  end of the week\, I'm going to present you what I have done during the last
  part of my internship.\nCollateral resource consumption on mobile devices i
 s a well-known issue that mobile developers are facing. The objective of my 
 internship was to analyze the trade-off between the precision and the resour
 ce consumption of mobile applications. To know more about the solution I imp
 lemented to answer this question\, come to see my talk this Thursday.\n\n"\n
 \nThe presentation is held this Thursday at 1 pm\, in room Minquiers.\n\nChe
 ers\,\n
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéoprojecteur )" <rennes-salle_mi
 nquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
ATTENDEE;CN=Enzo Menegaldo;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED:mailto:enz
 o.menegaldo@irisa.fr
ATTENDEE;CN=diverse;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mai
 lto:diverse@inria.fr
ATTENDEE;CN="Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025, Vidéoprojecteur )";CUTYPE=RESOURC
 E;ROLE=NON-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED:mailto:rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbr
 a-local.inria.fr
ORGANIZER;CN=Amine Benelallam:mailto:amine.benelallam@inria.fr
