BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0e94441d-8d0b-4373-b1f6-6d589ab307ac
SUMMARY:Visit Tanja
DESCRIPTION:FYI: Tanja ( https://www.big.tuwien.ac.at/staff/tmayerhofer ) wo
 uld visit us (to be confirmed in few days) to work on model executability fo
 r CPS\, and more concretely on the integration of xMOF in the GEMOC studio\,
  and the generalization of a generic model execution framework for language 
 engineering. Feel free to benefit from her visit to engage shared discussion
 \, writing and development. \n\nHer visit is in the context of the COST Acti
 on MPM4CPS ( http://www.cost.eu/COST_Actions/ict/IC1404 and http://www.mpm4c
 ps.eu ). \n\n@Tifenn: she will cover herself the costs (being reimbursed by 
 the COST Action). she can also use the third desk of my office. can we provi
 de her a key? would it be possible to ask for a 5-day visitor pass? \n\nMany
  thanks\, \nBenoit \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>Nouvelle demande 
 de réunion ci-dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>
 Sujet :</th><td>Visit Tanja </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:</th
 ><td>"Benoit Combemale" &lt\;benoit.combemale@irisa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</ta
 ble>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Début :</th><td>Lundi 9 Ma
 i 2016\, Toute la journée\n </td></tr><tr><th align=left>Fin :</th><td>Vendr
 edi 13 Mai 2016\, Toute la journée\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border=
 '0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>didier.vojtisek@inria.fr\; benoit.
 baudry@inria.fr\; dorian.leroy@irisa.fr\; fabien.coulon@inria.fr\; thomas.de
 gueule@inria.fr\; olivier.barais@irisa.fr\; tifenn.donguy@irisa.fr </td></tr
 >\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: time
 s new roman\, new york\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><
 div>FYI: Tanja (<a href="https://www.big.tuwien.ac.at/staff/tmayerhofer">htt
 ps://www.big.tuwien.ac.at/staff/tmayerhofer</a>) would visit us (to be confi
 rmed in few days)&nbsp\;to work on model executability for CPS\, and more co
 ncretely on the integration of xMOF in the GEMOC studio\, and the generaliza
 tion of a generic model execution framework for language engineering. Feel f
 ree to benefit from her visit to engage shared discussion\, writing and deve
 lopment.&nbsp\;</div><div><br></div><div>Her visit is in the context of the 
 COST Action MPM4CPS (<a href="http://www.cost.eu/COST_Actions/ict/IC1404">ht
 tp://www.cost.eu/COST_Actions/ict/IC1404</a>&nbsp\;and&nbsp\;<a href="http:/
 /www.mpm4cps.eu/">http://www.mpm4cps.eu</a>).&nbsp\;</div><div><br></div><di
 v>@Tifenn: she will cover herself the costs (being reimbursed by the COST Ac
 tion). she can also use the third desk of my office. can we provide her a ke
 y? would it be possible to ask for a 5-day visitor pass?</div><div><br></div
 ><div>Many thanks\,</div><div>Benoit</div></div></body></html>
