BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0ea92274-bd01-4e84-8b59-c8ab5b478c28
SUMMARY:[SEMINAR] Theory category for dummies (J. MArchand)
DESCRIPTION:\nTheory category has been introduced in the 40s by mathematicia
 ns needing a powerful tool to deal with algebraic topology. It appeared that
  its application field was largely wider than that\, unifying under a common
  and simple abstract language many different structures and operations comin
 g from various fields of mathematics. It has also been successfully used in 
 various fields of computer science\, including software engineering. \nDurin
 g this seminar\, I propose to present this theory and to give an overview of
  some of its basic\, yet useful\, constructions. \n
LOCATION:lipari
