BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0F1DA944-DBEC-46A3-8F6F-EEED574FB2B1
SUMMARY:Industry 4.0 Call
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\,\n\n\n\nwe should discuss how we proceed\, i.e.\,\n\n   
 -          Do we restrict to A/B level conferences?\n\n   -          What ab
 out workshops?\n\n   -          What are the next steps? (there’s ca. 240 pa
 pers to be scanned)\n\n   -          What’s the roadmap to make it to the So
 SyM deadline (June 15)?\n\n         o    Finish scanning (ca. 60 papers each
 ) by June 01\n\n         o    Synthesis by June 07\n\n         o    Ask for 
 deadline extension by June 07\n\n         o    Finish by June 30\n\n        
  o    (is that realistic / possible?)\n\n\n\nBest\,\n\nAndreas\n
LOCATION:Skype (I call)
