 e plan of another paper
DESCRIPTION:Hello\, \n\nThis meeting is for: \n\n\n    1. Discuss the target
  for the middleware's paper and what modifications are needed \n    2. Discu
 ss the extended introduction of the new paper describing the DSL (I will sen
 d the document on Monday 10). This introduction will include the global idea
  but it will also contains the whole plan of the paper\, specially a descrip
 tion of the evaluation. \n\nMaybe we need more than a hour \n\n\n
