BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:12d7e334-c7f2-4215-8092-c0c34dae96fc
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\n\nFor our next DiverSE coffee\, we're having a tech
 nical presentation about mining Github repositories\, by Oscar Luis Vera Pér
 ez. \nHe'll be showing us how to explore projects of interest in Github and 
 extract valuable knowledge and insights. \nThe presentation concludes with p
 ointers to where documentation and libraries for all major programming langu
 ages can be found. \n\n\nThe presentation is very likely held in Markov room
  (G105) at 1 p.m. \nCome over to see for yourself! \nBut meanwhile\, enjoy t
 he video of the international Github anthem! Don't forget to vote up the ama
 zing talent behind it : -p \n\n\nCheers\, \n\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watc
 h?v=q_QjA7PgWZs \n\n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>DiverSE Coffee </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organiser:</th
 ><td>"Amine Benelallam" &lt\;amine.benelallam@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</ta
 ble>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Time:</th><td>Thursday\, 1
 1 May\, 2017\, 1:00:00 PM - 2:00:00 PM GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Ma
 drid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=le
 ft>Invitees:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*
 ~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: times new roman\, new york\, time
 s\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>Hi all\,&nbsp\;</div><div
 ><br></div><div><p style="margin: 0px\;" data-mce-style="margin: 0px\;">For 
 our next DiverSE coffee\, we're having a technical presentation about mining
  Github repositories\, by Oscar Luis Vera Pérez.<br>He'll be showing us how 
 to explore projects of interest in Github and extract valuable knowledge and
  insights.<br>The presentation concludes with pointers to where documentatio
 n and libraries for all major programming languages can be found.</p><p styl
 e="margin: 0px\;" data-mce-style="margin: 0px\;"><br></p><p style="margin: 0
 px\;" data-mce-style="margin: 0px\;">The presentation is very likely held in
  Markov room (G105) at 1 p.m.&nbsp\;</p><p style="margin: 0px\;" data-mce-st
 yle="margin: 0px\;"><span style="font-size: 12pt\;">Come over to see for you
 rself! </span></p><p style="margin: 0px\;" data-mce-style="margin: 0px\;"><s
 pan style="font-size: 12pt\;">But meanwhile\, enjoy the </span><a data-mce-h
 ref="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q_QjA7PgWZs" href="https://www.youtube.
 com/watch?v=q_QjA7PgWZs" style="font-size: 12pt\;">video</a><span style="fon
 t-size: 12pt\;"> of the international Github&nbsp\;anthem! Don't forget to v
 ote up the amazing talent behind </span>it :<span style="font-size: 12pt\;">
 -p&nbsp\;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px\;" data-mce-style="margin: 0px\;">
 <span style="font-size: 12pt\;"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px\;" data
 -mce-style="margin: 0px\;">Cheers\,</p><p style="margin: 0px\;" data-mce-sty
 le="margin: 0px\;"><br></p><p style="margin: 0px\;" data-mce-style="margin: 
 0px\;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q_QjA7PgWZs">https://www.you
 tube.com/watch?v=q_QjA7PgWZs</a></p></div><div><br></div></div></body></html
 >
