BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:15f597c5-8637-4345-822f-a6e50fcb12e8
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nWe're happy to have Fabien tomorrow as our next Div
 erSE Coffee speaker. He will introduce Quarkus [1]\, a new framework by RedH
 at for making microservices in Java.\n\nEnters @Fabien: Quarkus' objective i
 s to produce super-small microservices with super fast loading. With Quarkus
 \, you can write micro-services very quickly with only a few Java annotation
 s\, respecting well-established standards and benefiting from an entire ecos
 ystem. Supersonic Subatomic Java!\n\nYou can't miss the opportunity to learn
  more about Quarkus\, a next-generation Kubernetes native Java framework.\n\
 nThe talk is held tomorrow in room Turing-Petri at 1 pm. \n\n[1] https://qua
 rkus.io/\n\nKind regards\,\nJuliana.\n\n
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Turing-Petri (G109-G107\, Vidéoprojecteur\, Salle sép
 arable en deux) [R]" <rennes-salle_turing-petri@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
ATTENDEE;CN=diverse;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:diverse@inria.fr
ATTENDEE;CN=Fabien Coulon;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:fabien.coul
 on@inria.fr
X-MS-OLK-SENDER:mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr
ORGANIZER;CN=Sophie Maupile;SENT-BY="mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr":
 mailto:sophie.maupile@irisa.fr
X-MS-OLK-SENDER:mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr
