UID:1d9e4ba9-dddd-4d0c-9501-4f51e1266ebe
SUMMARY:Pizza Farewell: Juliana
DESCRIPTION:Hi everyone\, \n\nAs some of you may already know\, February the
  28th is my last day at IRISA before going back to Brazil. \nI would love to
  have some pizza with you on the 2nd of March before I leave France. \n\nPle
 ase\, let me know if you are wishing to attend. \nI'm looking forward to see
 ing you all! \n\nCheers\, \nJuliana. \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>Pizza Farewell: Juliana </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organ
 izer:</th><td>"Juliana Alves pereira" &lt\;juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr&gt
 \; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Locatio
 n:</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Sein (B001)" &lt\;rennes-salle_sein@zimbra-local.in
 ria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Resources:</th><td>"Rennes-Salle 
 Sein (B001)" &lt\;rennes-salle_sein@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (Lieu : Renne
 s\, Bâtiment : A\, Étage : bleu\, Salle : B001) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=le
 ft>Time:</th><td>Monday\, March 2\, 2020\, 12:00:00 PM - 1:00:00 PM GMT +01:
 00 Amsterdam\, Berlin\, Bern\, Rome\, Stockholm\, Vienna\n </td></tr></table
 >\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invitees:</th><td>diverse@inr
 ia.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="fo
 nt-family: arial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 11pt\; color: #000000
 "><div>Hi everyone\,</div><div><br></div><div>As some of you may already kno
 w\, February the 28th is my last day at IRISA before going back to Brazil.</
 div><div>I would love to have some pizza with you on the 2nd of March before
  I leave France.</div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>Please\, let me
  know if you are wishing to attend.</div><div>I'm looking forward to seeing 
 you all!</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers\,</div><div>Juliana.</div><div><div
  style="font-size: 14.6667px\;" data-mce-style="font-size: 14.6667px\;"></di
 v></div><div><span class="ZmSearchResult" data-mce-style="background-color: 
 #fffec4\;" style="background-color: rgb(255\, 254\, 196)\;"><div></div></spa
 n></div></div></body></html>
