BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1e2aaa42-1a3e-42e4-82d6-355fea41bc0a
SUMMARY:Diverse cofeee
DESCRIPTION:\nOur colleague Pierre Lapedrix\, the Sherlock of our team\, wil
 l present his latest discoveries about fingerprinting. Actually\, He managed
  to get a publication about this subject and will be rehearsing for the upco
 ming event at "S&P'16" (aka "37th IEEE Symposium on Security and Privacy") w
 here he got his paper accepted. \n\n\nAccording to our colleague: "The talk 
 is about what we found when we analyzed the data from \nAmIUnique. Do not ex
 pect any Paul Temple references or you will be \ndisappointed!" \n\n\nSo you
  know\, you will need to go either with Paul Temple or Sherlock when detecti
 ng fingerprints... see you all this Thursday in LIPARI!! \n
