UID:1fc469ca-75e2-41a6-916d-b30674a2fb87
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Hi everyone\, \n\nFollowing the discussion about the DiverSE tea
 m website ( [ https://www.diverse-team.fr/ | https://www.diverse-team.fr/ ] 
 )\, the DiverSE Coffee of this Thursday will focus on the team's website. It
  will be a chance to update it and to define the different issues as well as
  to resolve them. A discussion on the improvement and management of the site
  may complete this mini-workshop. \n\nFeel free to visit the website and cre
 ate issues on the associated [ https://github.com/diverse-team/diverse-team.
 github.io | GitHub project ] before the meeting so that we can discuss/resol
 ve them during the DiverSE Coffee. \n\nSee you on Thursday in room Sicile at
  1 pm! \n\nBest regards\, \nJune \n\nPS: Don't forget to bring your laptop \
 ;)! \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>Nouvelle demande 
 de réunion ci-dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>
