 /th><td>"June Benvegnu-Sallou" &lt\;june.benvegnu-sallou@irisa.fr&gt\; </td>
 </tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><
 td>"Rennes-Salle Sicile (F302\, Vidéoprojecteur\, Visioconférence\, Audiocon
 férence)" &lt\;rennes-salle_sicile@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n<t
 r><th align=left>Ressources :</th><td>"Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage 
 : vert\, Salle : F302" &lt\;rennes-salle_sicile@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (
 Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : vert\, Salle : F302) </td></tr>\n<tr>
 <th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Jeudi 23 Janvier 2020\, 13:00:00 - 14:00:00 GM
 T +01:00 Bruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n
 <table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr\; f
 rederic.collonval@safrangroup.com </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*
 ~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: arial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; font
 -size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>Hi everyone\,<br data-mce-bogus="1"></div
 ><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>Following the discussion about the D
 iverSE team website (<a href="https://www.diverse-team.fr/" data-mce-href="h
 ttps://www.diverse-team.fr/">https://www.diverse-team.fr/</a>)\, the DiverSE
  Coffee of this Thursday will focus on the team's website. It will be a chan
 ce to update it and to define the different issues as well as to resolve the
 m. A discussion on the improvement and management of the site may complete t
 his mini-workshop.<br></div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>Feel free
  to visit the website and create issues on the associated <a href="https://g
 ithub.com/diverse-team/diverse-team.github.io" data-mce-href="https://github
 .com/diverse-team/diverse-team.github.io">GitHub project</a> before the meet
 ing so that we can discuss/resolve them during the DiverSE Coffee.<br data-m
 ce-bogus="1"></div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>See you on Thursda
 y in room Sicile at 1 pm!<br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div><br data-mce-bogu
 s="1"></div><div>Best regards\,<br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>June<br dat
 a-mce-bogus="1"></div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>PS: Don't forge
 t to bring your laptop \;)!<br data-mce-bogus="1"></div></div></body></html>
