UID:1m2oak8e7avhrh3nan48imk3sq@google.com
SUMMARY:eCAROS WP1\; domain scenarios discussion
DESCRIPTION:Further update: <b><u>we meet on Hangout!</u></b><br><br>--&gt\;
  Hangout is preferred\, so please try to join that first:<br><br><b>Option a
 :</b> Hangout:&nbsp\;<a href="https://meet.google.com/cyz-ybya-dgv?hs=122" i
 d="ow4074" __is_owner="true">meet.google.com/cyz-ybya-dgv</a><br><br><b>Opti
 on b:</b> Web-X:&nbsp\;<table><tbody><tr><td><table><tbody><tr><td><p><a hre
 f="https://arkadin-ccatrial.webex.com/arkadin-ccatrial/meet/charles.robinson
 ">Join meeting room</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></tab
 le>Meeting number (access code): 927 032 845<br>&nbsp\;<b>In case a need to 
 dial in using your phone:</b><p>Austria: +43 192 883 35\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Fran
 ce: +33 170 950 594\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;Germany: +49 692 5736 7317&nbsp\;<
 br>Ireland: +353 169 509 69\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Italy: +39 06 875 020 89\;&nbsp\
 ;&nbsp\; Spain: +34 914 192 777<u></u><u></u></p><p>United Kingdom: +44 20 3
 00 924 77&nbsp\;</p><p><u></u></p><p>(<a href="https://arkadin-ccatrial.webe
 x.com/arkadin-ccatrial/globalcallin.php?serviceType=MC&amp\;ED=779070692&amp
 \;tollFree=1">Other global call-in numbers</a>)&nbsp\;<a href="https://help.
 webex.com/docs/DOC-5412">Difficulty joining the meeting?</a></p><table><tbod
 y><tr><td><b><br><br></b></td></tr></tbody></table><b>Option C:</b> Skype:&n
 bsp\;<a href="https://join.skype.com/GK4dgbXnLhWK">https://join.skype.com/GK
 4dgbXnLhWK</a><br><br><p><u></u></p><table><tbody><tr><td>Document for notes
 :<br><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Eh_xUGTCRUAZHj0KepESWh0tSg
 I1SdmMDn-Krvd-fFM/edit">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Eh_xUGTCRUAZHj0K
 epESWh0tSgI1SdmMDn-Krvd-fFM/edit</a><b><br></b></td></tr><tr><td><br></td></
 tr></tbody></table><br>Talk to most of you later :)<br><br><b><p>-----------
 -------------------------</p></b><br>Hi all\,<br><br>I think it's time to ha
 ve a first talk about the domain scenarios. Maybe we could get everyone toge
 ther who will be heavily involved in the domain scenarios (+ those who have 
 time and are interested). I think a preliminary agenda could be:<br><br>- in
 troduction round<br>- domain scenarios intro: maintenance &amp\; inspection\
 , healthcare<br>- domain scenario description in proposal section 1<br>- WP1
  tasks and involvement\, next steps<br>- missing input for section 2<br><br>
 @THALES: I think it's important you guys have time\, so in case this time do
 esn't fit for you\; we can find another slot (we are free: TUE 4pm\, WE 3pm)
 <br><br>Have a great weekend everyone!<br><br>P.S: I have added a Hangout li
 nk\, but we can also switch to Skype.\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nPlease do not edit thi
 s section of the description.\n\nThis event has a video call.\nJoin: https:/
 /meet.google.com/cyz-ybya-dgv\n+45 70 71 41 93 PIN: 458618577#\nView more ph
 one numbers: https://tel.meet/cyz-ybya-dgv?pin=2076093342936&hs=7\n\nView yo
 ur event at https://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=VIEW&eid=MW0yb2FrOG
 U3YXZocmgzbmFuNDhpbWszc3Egb2xpdmllci5iYXJhaXNAaXJpc2EuZnI&tok=MjYjZmtAYmx1ZS
 1vY2Vhbi1yb2JvdGljcy5jb200YzUwMTljYjRhM2M1ZmY1MDQ1MzhiOWNiMTZjM2E5ZWUyYTA3MT
 Jm&ctz=Europe%2FCopenhagen&hl=en&es=0.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-
