 C Phone Conference in the project SPEEDS.\nDate:\nTime:\nLocation:\n2009-02-
 16\n10:00-11:30\n\nI would like to invite you to the ext HRC phone meeting.\
 nTopics:\n* Status of WPs\n* Next deliverables\n* next physical meeting\n* p
 roblems / risks\n* misc.\n\nPlease dial\n49 69 27 11 38 00 \nAccess Code: 55
 562#\nParticipants:\nAlain Le Guennec\, Alberto Ferrari\, Benoit Caillaud\, 
 Bernhard Josko\, Didier Simoneau\, Eldad Palachi\, Hans-Martin Schulz\, Marc
  Enzmann\, PARADES PARADES\, Susanne Graf\, Thomas Capelle\, Vered Gafni\n\n
