UID:20091012T112828Z-10736b9-2ee0-34922012-Oracle
SUMMARY:[O][SEMINAR] GALAXY\, an open SOA platform enabling agility using dy
 namic architectures (Mahmoud Ben Hassine)
DESCRIPTION:ABSTRACT : \nThe goal that the galaxy ADT aims at achieving is t
 o provide an IT agile platform\, built on dynamic software architecture prin
 ciples\, and fitting for flexibility\, dynamic reconfiguration\, adaptabilit
 y\, continuity and autonomic computing. Fractal\, SCA-Tinfi and GCM-ProActiv
 e are the major technologies which will be the technological drivers of this
  ADT. The different usage scenarios as well as the different tools which wil
 l be developed at application and business levels will demonstrate that this
  platform is able to support the design\, modelling\, deployment and executi
 on of business processes.
LOCATION:Lipari
