BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20091216T171626Z-77152-2ee0-1f319576-Oracle
SUMMARY:[O]Code Camp Kermeta V2
DESCRIPTION:The goal of this meeting is to kick-off the implementation in Ke
 rmeta of the Kermeta V2 compiler.\nEverybody brings his computer\, and get r
 eady to program.\nAgenda:\n- 30 min presentation of the compiler architectur
 e by Francois and Olivier\n- 15 min practicalities by Didier and Jean-Marc\n
 - write test for each Kermeta metaclass (The Integer is for me!)\n- implemen
 t a compile method for each meta-class (The Integer is for me\, again!)\nand
  here we go\, we get a new compiler \;-)\n\nPlease confirm your availability
  for this great piece of fun (free food provided!) through the agenda.\n
LOCATION:Rennes-Salle Lipari
