BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:200e3717-1418-4444-9604-b4c61d48787d
SUMMARY:Re: [DIVERSIFY] next meeting
DESCRIPTION:Hello\, \n\n\nWe'll have our next meeting on Wednesday\, March 7
 th from 10 to 12 am\, CET\, with the agenda below. \n\n\nBenoit \n\n\n\n\n\n
 Le 29 févr. 2012 à 15:23\, Benoit Baudry a écrit : \n\n\n\nHello\, \n\n\nFir
 st of all welcome to Siobhan Clarke and Hui Song from Trinity College Dublin
  (TCD) who have joined us on this proposal \n\n\nI would like to plan a meet
 ing next week with the three of us (INRIA\, SINTEF\, TCD) to: \n\n\n1- discu
 ss CAS perturbation scenarios which we'll use to motivate the need for softw
 are diversity and to experiment our solutions. Initial input for these scena
 rios\, covering different forms of perturbations\, will be provided by TCD\,
  based on their expertise in urban-scale CAS. \n\n\n2- discuss the organizat
 ion of work to write the proposal \n\n\n3- feedback from L-up\, the consulti
 ng company that will help us set up this proposal. I have a meeting with the
 m tomorrow. \n\n\nPlease fill the following doodle poll for this meeting: ht
 tp://www.doodle.com/536eegaybqezgyxi \n\n\nThank you \n\n\nAll the best\, \n
 Benoit \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>Nouvelle demande de réunion ci-
 dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><t
 d>Re: [DIVERSIFY] next meeting </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:<
 /th><td>"Johann Bourcier" &lt\;johann.bourcier@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</t
 able>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Mercredi 7
  Mars 2012\, 10:00:00 - 12:00:00 GMT +01:00 Bruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\
 , Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>In
 vités:</th><td>"Benoit Baudry" &lt\;benoit.baudry@inria.fr&gt\;\; "Olivier B
 arais" &lt\;barais@irisa.fr&gt\;\; "Johann Bourcier" &lt\;Johann.Bourcier@ir
 isa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div sty
 le='font-family:times new roman\,new york\,times\,serif\; font-size: 12pt\; 
 color: #000000\;'>Hello\,<div><br></div><div>We'll have our next meeting on 
 Wednesday\, March 7th from 10 to 12 am\, CET\, with the agenda below.</div><
 div><br></div><div>Benoit</div><div><br></div><div><br><div><div>Le 29 févr.
  2012 à 15:23\, Benoit Baudry a écrit :</div><br class="Apple-interchange-ne
 wline"><blockquote><div style="word-wrap: break-word\; -webkit-nbsp-mode: sp
 ace\; -webkit-line-break: after-white-space\; ">Hello\,<div><br></div><div>F
 irst of all welcome to Siobhan Clarke and Hui Song from Trinity College Dubl
 in (TCD) who have joined us on this proposal</div><div><br></div><div>I woul
 d like to plan a meeting next week with the three of us (INRIA\, SINTEF\, TC
 D) to:</div><div><br></div><div>1- discuss CAS perturbation scenarios which 
 we'll use to motivate the need for software diversity and to experiment our 
 solutions. Initial input for these scenarios\, covering different forms of p
 erturbations\, will be provided by TCD\, based on their expertise in urban-s
 cale CAS.</div><div><br></div><div>2- discuss the organization of work to wr
 ite the proposal</div><div><br></div><div>3- feedback from L-up\, the consul
 ting company that will help us set up this proposal. I have a meeting with t
 hem tomorrow.</div><div><br></div><div>Please fill the following doodle poll
  for this meeting:&nbsp\;<a id="participationLink" name="participationLink" 
 href="http://www.doodle.com/536eegaybqezgyxi" target="_blank">http://www.doo
 dle.com/536eegaybqezgyxi</a></div><div><br></div><div>Thank you</div><div><b
 r></div><div>All the best\,</div><div>Benoit</div></div></blockquote></div><
 br></div></div></body></html>
