UID:205ed0d5-0c26-41d9-b2fe-2f883c08d5df
SUMMARY:[DIVERSIFY] bi-partite model preparation for Oslo
DESCRIPTION:Hi\,\n\nThanks for filling the doodle\nINRIA and UR1 will prepar
 e elements for the discussion and the objective of the meeting will be to es
 tablish a precise set of concepts and questions we want to discuss with the 
 ecologists in Oslo.\n\nCheers\,\nBenoit
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>Nouvelle demande de réunion ci-
 dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><t
 d>[DIVERSIFY] bi-partite model preparation for Oslo </td></tr>\n<tr><th alig
 n=left>Organisateur:</th><td>"Benoit Baudry" &lt\;benoit.baudry@inria.fr&gt\
 ; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</
 th><td>Vendredi 14 Juin 2013\, 13:00:00 - 14:00:00 GMT +01:00 Bruxelles\, Co
 penhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr
 ><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>Franck.Fleurey@sintef.no\; franck.chauvel@s
 intef.no\; hui.song@scss.tcd.ie\; Vivek.Nallur@scss.tcd.ie\; benoit.combemal
 e@irisa.fr\; barais@irisa.fr\; johann.bourcier@inria.fr\; simon.allier@inria
 .fr\; marco.biazzini@inria.fr\; cendrine.mony@univ-rennes1.fr\; gauzens@gmai
 l.com ... </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br>Hi\,<br><b
 r>Thanks for filling the doodle<br>INRIA and UR1 will prepare elements for t
 he discussion and the objective of the meeting will be to establish a precis
 e set of concepts and questions we want to discuss with the ecologists in Os
 lo.<br><br>Cheers\,<br>Benoit</body></html>
