UID:20dd7c17-df20-4c9d-8d45-76ad1ce4de77
SUMMARY:Annual CSI meeting 2020 - Alif Akbar Pranata
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nToday's meeting will be on Renater at 2 pm. \n\nTo 
 join : [ https://rdv1.rendez-vous.renater.fr/csialif | https://rdv1.rendez-v
 ous.renater.fr/csialif ] \n\nSee you later! \n\nAlif \n\n-------------------
 ---------------------------------- \n\nHi Ludovic\, \n\nMy CSID will be on J
 une 3\, 2020 at 14h00. \n\nRegards\, \n\n-----------------------------------
 ------------------ \n\nDear all\, \n\n\n\nThe annual CSI meeting will be hel
 d on June 3\, 2020 at 14h00-15h30. I will send the report 7 days before. \n\
 n\nHave a good day! \n\n\nAlif \n\n\n\n\nFrom: "Alif Akbar Pranata" <alif-ak
 bar.pranata@inria.fr> \nTo: "Olivier Barais" <olivier.barais@irisa.fr>\, "Jo
 hann BOURCIER" <johann.bourcier@irisa.fr>\, "Université" <gerson.sunye@univ-
 nantes.fr>\, "Yassine HADJADJ-AOUL" <yassine.hadjadj-aoul@irisa.fr>\, "Gerso
 n Sunyé" <gerson.sunye@inria.fr> \nSent: Tuesday\, April 14\, 2020 9:11:51 A
 M \nSubject: Annual CSI meeting - Alif Akbar Pranata \n\n\n\nDear CSI commit
 tee\, \n\n\n\nI am Alif\, a second-year PhD student at INRIA-Univ Rennes 1. 
 Herewith I would like to invite all the committee for the annual CSI meeting
 . \n\n\nThe meeting will be conducted by Visio conferencing unless circumsta
 nces are changing. I will send the annual report to all committee 7 days bef
 ore the meeting. Kindly find below the Doodle form for possible meeting date
  and time. \n\n\n[ https://doodle.com/poll/qxzp24463tig6yvu | Go to Doodle F
 orm ] \n\n\nHave a good day! \n\nAlif Akbar Pranata \nINRIA Rennes - Bretagn
 e Atlantique \nCampus de Beaulieu\, Bât 12E\, bureau E207 \n263 Av du Généra
 l Leclerc\, 35042 Rennes \nWebsite: [ http://sites.google.com/view/alif-akba
 r-pranata | http://sites.google.com/view/alif-akbar-pranata ] \nEmail: [ mai
 lto:alif-akbar.pranata@inria.fr | alif-akbar.pranata@inria.fr ] \; [ mailto:
 alifakbarp@gmail.com | alifakbarp@gmail.com ] \n\n
