BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:229cd240-978d-4b67-aa43-3c874636b00f
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee: Benoit Baudry
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\,\n\nWe'll have Benoit Baudry tomorrow as our next DiverS
 E Coffee speaker presenting his current research.\n\nBenoit Baudry is a Prof
 essor in Software Technology at the KTH Royal Institute of Technology\, wher
 e he leads the CASTOR software research center. He received his PhD in 2003 
 from the University of Rennes and was a research scientist at INRIA from 200
 4 to 2017. His research interests include dynamic code analysis\, automated 
 software engineering and software diversification.\n\nThe presentation is he
 ld in room Aurigny at 2 pm. \n\nKind regards\,\nJuliana.
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Aurigny (D165\, Vidéoprojecteur\, Visioconférence)" <
 rennes-salle_aurigny@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
