BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:22ba77df-c318-4075-8a6b-e7f86f84306e
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee [Juliana Alves Pereira]:
DESCRIPTION:The following meeting has been modified:\n\nSubject: DiverSE Cof
 fee [Juliana Alves Pereira]: [MODIFIED]\nOrganiser: "Amine Benelallam" <amin
 e.benelallam@inria.fr> \n\nLocation: "Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéopr
 ojecteur )" <rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr> \nResources: "Ren
 nes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéoprojecteur )" <rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbr
 a-local.inria.fr> (Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéoprojecteur )) \nTime:
  Thursday\, 27 September\, 2018\, 13:00:00 - 14:00:00 GMT +01:00 Brussels\, 
 Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n \nInvitees: diverse@inria.fr\; juliana.alves-p
 ereira@irisa.fr \n\n\n*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*\n\nHi all\, \n\nYou've all already
  meet Juliana\, either in the corridor or during a team break. \n\nRegardles
 s if you've already had the chance to discuss with her about her PhD topic o
 r not\, get to know more about her research activities in the DiverSE Coffee
  next week.\n\nEnters Juliana:\n\nIn this talk\, I will present a bit of mys
 elf and what I have been working on in the last three years during my Ph.D. 
 at the University of Magdeburg\, Germany. Below a quick summary of the talk.
 \n\nSoftware Product Lines (SPLs) have been employed in the industry as a ma
 ss customization process that reduces production costs and time-to-market. H
 owever\, the inherent complexity and variability of SPLs lead to an exponent
 ially growing amount of possible products. Thus\, especially when dealing wi
 th large SPLs\, scalability and performance concerns start to be an issue an
 d specialized assistance becomes crucial to guide decision makers during pro
 duct configuration. In this context\, SPL configuration has been a hot resea
 rch topic in the last years. My talk is mainly about the use of recommendati
 on techniques to enable an efficient SPL configuration process and provide a
 ccurate and scalable solutions to decision makers. First\, I will provide an
  overview of the implemented techniques and visual support that allows decis
 ion makers to focus on a limited set of valid and relevant parts of the conf
 iguration space. Then\, I will empirically demonstrate the usability of the 
 implemented techniques in different real-world scenarios from different doma
 ins.\n\nThe presentation is held in Room Minquiers\, Thursday\, September 27
 th at 1 pm.\n\nRegards
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéoprojecteur )" <rennes-salle_mi
 nquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
ATTENDEE;CN=diverse;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mai
 lto:diverse@inria.fr
ATTENDEE;CN=Juliana Alves pereira;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION
 ;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr
ATTENDEE;CN="Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025, Vidéoprojecteur )";CUTYPE=RESOURC
 E;ROLE=NON-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED:mailto:rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbr
 a-local.inria.fr
ORGANIZER;CN=Amine Benelallam:mailto:amine.benelallam@inria.fr
