UID:249178d4-6ca5-436c-a22d-a60e39c436b6
SUMMARY:[seminar] Software engineering for adaptive and cloud systems
DESCRIPTION:Hello\, \n\nWe are currently hosting two visitors in the context
  of the RELATE project. \nThey will introduce their work during this seminar
 . The first talk will be about the intrusion detection in elastic cloud envi
 ronments\, the second talk will be about invariant refinement for component-
 based systems: \n- Benchmarking of VMM-based IDSes and Cloud Research at SPE
 C (Aleksandar Milenkoski\, Karlsruhe Institute of Technology\, Germany) \n- 
 Design of DEECo-based Systems based on Invariant Refinement (Ilias Gerostath
 opoulos\, Prague University\, Czech Republic) \n\nBenoit \n\n\n
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Sardaigne (F102)" <rennes-salle_sardaigne@zimbra-loca
 l.inria.fr>
