UID:2ac67539-bcf4-4a3a-ade8-c94a2b520539
SUMMARY:DiverSE coffee : Paul
DESCRIPTION:This week\, I will do the presentation.\n\nWe had some prelimina
 ry results about the execution of different Computer Vision programs over di
 fferent videos\nthat I would like to share with you.\n\nIt will be also the 
 opportunity for me to introduce my PhD topic to new member of the team since
  it has been a while since I have made a presentation.\n\nSee you in room Le
 s Minquiers
