 ; color: #000000"><div style="font-family: times new roman\, new york\, time
 s\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>Hi Team\,<br></div><div><
 br></div><div>with the new year starts again our weekly (or so) DiverSE coff
 ee !<br></div><div><br></div><div>This week\, Kevin and Olivier offers a bra
 instorming session on ideas they have.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Kevin an
 d Olivier will discuss and challenge some ideas for diversity applied to sec
 urity.</div><div>They will present some intuitions they have on diversity ap
 plications but also the limitations of these ideas.<br></div><div><br></div>
 <div><br>The meeting will be held in one of the following room : Markov<br><
