BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2e61b21a-fab0-4377-83bf-0ba043b4d3e1
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee [Olivier Barais]: Sensitivity analysis using bash and
  docker swarm/kubernetes: a motivating scenario using Crucnhflow.
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nFor our next diverSE coffee \, we're happy to have 
 Olivier Barais among us to present his latest experiment on Sensitivity anal
 ysis using bash and docker swarm/ kubernetes . \nCrunchflow is primarily int
 ended for modeling and simulation of reactive flow and transport through por
 ous media (groundwater aquifers\, soils\, sediments\, crystalline rocks). \n
 \nThe presentation is held on Thursday in room Minquiers at 1 p.m. \n\nCheer
 s\, \n\n
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéoprojecteur )" <rennes-salle_mi
 nquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
