BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:31e31c9a-ceda-48bd-b97c-35299949285d
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee: New comers\, curriculum and background
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\,\n\nWelcoming the new PhDs\, we're going to have quick t
 alks by Alif and June about their curriculum and background.\n\nAlif Akbar i
 s a new Ph.D. student working with Johann and Olivier on Chaos Engineering f
 or Network Infrastructures and Services in IoT Environments\, in collaborati
 on with Nokia project.\nJune\, an ISTIC alumni and a new Ph.D.student\, is w
 orking with Johann and Benoit B. on decision support for risk assessment ass
 ociated with subsurface environment exploitation\, in collaboration with Jea
 n-Reynald De Dreuzy\, from OSUR.\n\n\nThe presentation is taking place this 
 Thursday at 1 pm. in Room Lipari.\n\nRegards\,
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202 Vidéoprojecteur\, Visioconférence)" <ren
 nes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
