BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:332ca63c-7a1e-443f-b132-4bbe26f98294
SUMMARY:DiverSE coffee : Arnaud
DESCRIPTION:This week Arnaud will present Valeria's work published at EICS'1
 6 called : \nAutomatic Detection of GUI Design Smells: The Case of Blob List
 ener \n\nIn this work\, they focus on GUI controllers and the detection of a
  new type of design smell\, called Blob Listener. \n\nResults showed that 21
  % of the analyzed GUI controllers are Blob listeners. \n\nThe talk will be 
 held in room Aurigny (Building D\; orange level) \n\nPS : hopefully he will 
 also tell the story of how the famous tetris' music was created (or maybe si
 ng some France Gall's songs) just to put you in the mood 
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Aurigny (D165\, visioconférence)" <rennes-salle_aurig
