UID:35d7e01e-9ea3-4a28-9aaf-6191331e6161
SUMMARY:Fresh PhD Seminar
DESCRIPTION:Hi everybody. \nThe next fresh PhD seminar will take place on th
 e 8th of November. \nWe'll have a PhD thesis presented by Clement. \nNicolas
 \, Olivier\, and Tam will present an article. \n\nNormally\, I have double c
 hecked the Lipari room booking this time\, so we'll be there\;) \nBest\, \nJ
 ohann \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>Nouvelle demande de réunion ci-
 dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><t
 d>Fresh PhD Seminar </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:</th><td>"Jo
 hann Bourcier" &lt\;johann.bourcier@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\
 n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><td>Lipari </td></tr>\
 n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Lundi 8 Novembre 2010\, 10:00:00 - 12:00:
 00 GMT +01:00 Bruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n
 <p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>"Emmanuelle Rou
 ille" <emmanuelle.rouille@irisa.fr>\; "Clement Guy" <clement.guy@inria.fr>\;
  "Naouel Moha" <naouel.moha@irisa.fr>\; "Loic Lesage" <loic.lesage@inria.fr>
 \; "Olivier-Nathanael Ben_david" <olivier-nathanael.ben_david@inria.fr>\; "T
 am Le_nhan" <tam.le_nhan@inria.fr>\; "Nicolas Sannier" <nicolas.sannier@iris
 a.fr>\; "Mahmoud Ben_hassine" <mahmoud.ben_hassine@inria.fr>\; "Jacques Falc
 ou" <jacques.falcou@inria.fr>\; "Juan-Jose Cadavid_gomez" <juan-jose.cadavid
 _gomez@inria.fr>\;  ... </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div>
 <br><div style='font-family:Times New Roman\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #0000
 00\;'>Hi everybody.<br>The next fresh PhD seminar will take place on the 8th
  of November.<br>We'll have a PhD thesis presented by Clement.<br>Nicolas\, 
 Olivier\, and Tam will present an article.<br><br>Normally\, I have double c
 hecked the Lipari room booking this time\, so we'll be there\;)<br>Best\,<br
 >Johann<br></div></body></html>
