BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:36d233e6-df70-46fe-b84d-c3834dcc4f3d
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Hi everyone\,\n\nNext week\, we will have the pleasure to welcom
 e Frédéric (from Safran) as our DiverSE coffee speaker.\nHe will talk about 
 "how to speed-up the pre-design phase by combining MBSE and physical simulat
 ion".\n\nEnters @Frédéric: "Aircraft design is entering a new era with new f
 unctions like taxiing and higher environmental constraints. To achieve this\
 , the major company is embracing model-based engineering. But quickly evalua
 ting the potential of an architecture remains a challenge that required comp
 lex physical simulations involving expert of various fields. In this present
 ation\, a simulation tool developed at Safran Group to address that problem 
 will be described and demonstrated."\n\nThe talk will take place in room Lip
 ari at 1 pm.\n\nKind regards\,\nJuliana.\n
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202 Vidéoprojecteur\, Visioconférence)" <ren
 nes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
ATTENDEE;CN=diverse;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:diverse@inria.fr
ATTENDEE;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:frederic.collonval@safrangro
 up.com
ATTENDEE;CN=Benoit Combemale;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:benoit.c
 ombemale@irisa.fr
X-MS-OLK-SENDER:mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr
ORGANIZER;CN=Sophie Maupile;SENT-BY="mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr":
 mailto:sophie.maupile@irisa.fr
X-MS-OLK-SENDER:mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr
DTSTART;TZID="Europe/Brussels":20191205T130000
DTEND;TZID="Europe/Brussels":20191205T140000
