UID:37dc5221-4d35-424a-917e-a6ee52bc251b
SUMMARY:[SEMINAR] Models@Runtime for self-adaptive distributed architecture:
  the ART2 project (F. Fouquet)
DESCRIPTION:\nAfter a short reminder of Model@Runtime goals especially for d
 istributed architecture\, this presentation will overview the concepts and t
 ools developped in ART2 project. \nSOA & Event driven and component definiti
 on modularity will be parts of the main topics discussed. \n\nSecond part of
  the presentation will be a concrete overview of the actual state of the run
 time prototype & tools enriched by demonstrations. \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>La réunion suivante a été modif
 iée :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><td>[S
 EMINAR] Models@Runtime for self-adaptive distributed architecture: the ART2 
 project (F. Fouquet) [MODIFIÉ]</td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:</
 th><td>"Benoit Combemale" &lt\;benoit.combemale@irisa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</
 table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><td>Lipari
  </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Mardi 16 Novembre 2010\, 12:3
 0:00 - 13:30:00 GMT +01:00 Bruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></
 tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>"e
 mmanuelle Rouille" <emmanuelle.rouille@irisa.fr>\; "Clement Guy" <clement.gu
 y@inria.fr>\; "Naouel Moha" <naouel.moha@irisa.fr>\; "Loic Lesage" <loic.les
 age@inria.fr>\; "Olivier-Nathanael Ben_david" <olivier-nathanael.ben_david@i
 nria.fr>\; "Tam Le_nhan" <tam.le_nhan@inria.fr>\; "Nicolas Sannier" <nicolas
 .sannier@irisa.fr>\; "Mahmoud Ben_hassine" <mahmoud.ben_hassine@inria.fr>\; 
 "Jacques Falcou" <jacques.falcou@inria.fr>\; "Juan-Jose Cadavid_gomez" <juan
 -jose.cadavid_gomez@inria.fr>\;  ... </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~
 *~*~*~*</div><br><div style='font-family:Times New Roman\; font-size: 12pt\;
  color: #000000\;'><div style="font-family:Times New Roman\; font-size: 12pt
 \; color: #000000\;">After a short reminder of Model@Runtime goals especiall
 y for distributed architecture\, this presentation will overview the concept
 s and tools developped in ART2 project.<br>SOA &amp\; Event driven&nbsp\; an
 d component definition modularity will be parts of the main topics discussed
 .<br><br>Second part of the presentation will be a concrete overview of the 
 actual state of the runtime prototype &amp\; tools enriched by demonstration
 s.<br></div></div></body></html>
