BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3ab79051-6e23-4c06-9c40-c2aa1e1d2039
SUMMARY:[eCAROS] WP2 Discussion
DESCRIPTION:https://join.skype.com/m3HynMQ5CI5X \n\nDear all\, \n\nThis morn
 ing\, we have got a discussion to get a common pattern for the WP 1-2\,3\,4 
 regarding the integration and validation. Antonio will provide an example of
  the structure for Monday. \nI propose to postpone our meeting when we will 
 have the new WP structure template. \nI just write a first version of the ob
 jectives for WP2 and a WP2 structure based on my feeling at the end of the w
 orking document \nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1X3fMMH1D7mcyvO81AfHyNc
 8NqdBiLkMc7k1MjmPg84o/edit?usp=sharing \n\n@Christina\, @Brice\, @Christoph\
 , @all\, it is a draft could you criticize this beginning of text. I will ke
 ep working on it but I would like to know I miss some objectives of the WP. 
 \n\nI think we could do it offline before the next meeting. \n\nSorry to pos
 tpone this meeting lately but I am afraid that we discuss some parts that co
 uld change at the beginning of next week. \n\nI would be connected to the do
 cument\, so we could discuss by chat if you want to add something and even h
 ave a direct call if required. \n\nRegards \n\nOlivier \n\n\n\n\n\n\n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>La réunion suivan
