 \; font-size: 12pt\;"></div><div style="color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\; font-family:
  arial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\;">This morning\, we have 
 got a discussion to get a common pattern for the WP 1-2\,3\,4 regarding the 
 integration and validation. Antonio will provide an example of the structure
  for Monday.&nbsp\;</div><div style="color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\; font-family: ar
 ial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\;">I propose to postpone our 
 meeting when we will have the new WP structure template.&nbsp\;</div><div st
 yle="color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\; font-family: arial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; f
 ont-size: 12pt\;">I just write a first version of the objectives for WP2 and
  a WP2 structure based on my feeling at the end of the working document&nbsp
 \;</div><div style="color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\; font-family: arial\, helvetica\,
  sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\;">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1X3fMMH1
 D7mcyvO81AfHyNc8NqdBiLkMc7k1MjmPg84o/edit?usp=sharing</div><div style="color
 : rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\; font-family: arial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 
 12pt\;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\; font-family: arial\, h
 elvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\;">@Christina\, @Brice\, @Christoph\
 , @all\, it is a draft could you criticize this beginning of text. I will ke
 ep working on it but I would like to know I miss some objectives of the WP.&
 nbsp\;</div><div style="color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\; font-family: arial\, helveti
 ca\, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0\, 0\
 , 0)\; font-family: arial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\;">I th
