DESCRIPTION:Hey!\n\nFor the DiverSE Coffee tomorrow (Thursday)\, Arnaud prop
 oses to do some demos to show how the extension engine of junit5 works (how 
 we can write specific extensions in junit5) + a demo of assertJ.\n\nIt will 
 take place in room 'Sicile' at 1pm.\n\nSee you tomorrow\,\nJune
