UID:47b847d2-6110-478a-949e-6101c4f2943d
SUMMARY:DiverSE coffee : Axel & Alexandre + Amine + Oscar
DESCRIPTION:Hi Team\, \n\nthis week\, three presentation will be performed :
  \n\nfirst Oscar and Amine who have just arrived in the team will introduce 
 themselves\; \nafter that Axel & Alexandre will talk about the job they have
  done during their internship in the team. \n\nOscar and Amine will tell us 
 about they did before\, what they will do in the team\, who they will work w
 ith and a little about themselves (their hobbies\, etc.). \n\nAxel & Alexand
 re will also ask for advices to continue the work they did and that led to a
  VaMoS'17 paper. \nThis will be also the opportunity for us to say goodbye s
 ince they will be leaving by the end of the week. 
