UID:547a211f-b8b0-4513-a371-e9fe97b12e5e
SUMMARY:Brainstorming for killer app
DESCRIPTION:Hello\, \n\nFollowing the discussions about my thesis during Div
 erSE seminar\, we need to find a killer app for the reverse engineering of P
 CMs. \nThis meeting is an occasion to gather ideas from everyone that might 
 be interested in this project. \n\nSee you ! \nGuillaume \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>Nouvelle demande 
 de réunion ci-dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>
 Sujet :</th><td>Brainstorming for killer app </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>
 Organisateur:</th><td>"Guillaume Becan" &lt\;guillaume.becan@inria.fr&gt\; <
 /td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</
 th><td>"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.in
 ria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Ressources :</th><td>"Rennes-Sall
 e Lipari (F202)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (Lieu :
  Rennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : orange\, Salle : F202) </td></tr>\n<tr><th 
 align=left>Heure:</th><td>Lundi 26 Mai 2014\, 09:00:00 - 11:00:00 GMT +01:00
  Bruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table b
 order='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>mathieu.acher@irisa.fr\; Ben
 oit.Baudry@inria.fr\; nicolas.sannier@irisa.fr\; olivier.barais@irisa.fr\; a
 rnaud.blouin@irisa.fr\; jose-angel.galindo-duarte@inria.fr\; mauricio.alfere
 z@inria.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div styl
 e="font-family: times new roman\, new york\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt
 \; color: #000000"><div>Hello\,</div><div><br></div><div>Following the discu
 ssions about my thesis during DiverSE seminar\, we need to find a killer app
  for the reverse engineering of PCMs.</div><div>This meeting is an occasion 
 to gather ideas from everyone that might be interested in this project.</div
 ><div><br></div><div>See you !</div><div>Guillaume</div></div></body></html>
