UID:54fcc69f-547f-4065-8765-503d5fd8bc65
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee [Nelly Bencomo]
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nWe'll have [ http://www.nellybencomo.me/ | Dr. Nell
 y Bencomo ] as our DiverSE Coffee speaker this week. She will introduce hers
 elf and give a global presentation of her research work. This will be an opp
 ortunity to start discussions on possible joint projects to be launched. \;)
  \n\nThe talk will take place in room Sardaigne at 1 pm. And there WILL be c
 offee ! :D (But don't forget to bring your mug) \n\nBest regards\, \nJune \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>Nouvelle demande 
 de réunion ci-dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>
 Sujet :</th><td>DiverSE Coffee [Nelly Bencomo] </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=lef
 t>Organisateur:</th><td>"June Benvegnu-Sallou" &lt\;june.benvegnu-sallou@iri
 sa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left
 >Endroit :</th><td>"Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : bleu\, Salle : F1
 02" &lt\;rennes-salle_sardaigne@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n<tr><
 th align=left>Ressources :</th><td>"Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : b
 leu\, Salle : F102" &lt\;rennes-salle_sardaigne@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (
 Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : bleu\, Salle : F102) </td></tr>\n<tr>
 <th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Jeudi 3 Octobre 2019\, 13:00:00 - 14:00:00 GMT
  +01:00 Bruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<
 table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr\; ne
 lly.bencomo@inria.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br
 ><div style="font-family: arial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\;
  color: #000000"><div>Hi all\,</div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>W
 e'll have <a href="http://www.nellybencomo.me/" data-mce-href="http://www.ne
 llybencomo.me/">Dr. Nelly Bencomo</a> as our&nbsp\; DiverSE Coffee speaker t
 his week. She will introduce herself and give a global presentation of her r
 esearch work. This will be an opportunity to start discussions on possible j
 oint projects to be launched. \;)<br></div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div
 ><div>The talk will take place in room Sardaigne at 1 pm. And there WILL be 
 coffee !&nbsp\;:D (But don't forget to bring your mug)<br style=""><br style
 ="">Best regards\,<br style="">June</div></div></body></html>
LOCATION:"Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : bleu\, Salle : F102" <renne
 s-salle_sardaigne@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
