BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5c7c5c99-1970-4083-b193-2dfca91284ee
SUMMARY:DiverSE coffee : Gerson
DESCRIPTION:Hi team\, \n\nall of a mystery around this week talk (because ba
 sically I do not have a lot of information about it... '^^). \n\nIt has been
  a long time since Gerson did not speak in front of us. \nThis week he will 
 make a presentation on Model Consistency for Distributed Collaborative Model
 ing. \n\nPS : Here is the abstract :\nCurrent collaborative modeling tools u
 se a centralized architecture\, based on version control system\,\nwhere mod
 els are updated asynchronously.\nThese tools depend on a single server and a
 re not completely adapted for collaborative modeling\,\nwhere update reactiv
 ity is essential.\nIn this presentation\, I propose a framework for building
  collaborative modeling tools which provides synchronous model update.\nThe 
 framework is based on a peer-to-peer architecture and uses a consistency alg
 orithm for model updating.
