UID:5fe9aefe-6651-4c40-96d3-9cf8b87bf010
SUMMARY:Meeting with Inti
DESCRIPTION:Hello\, \n\nIs it possible to meet before your vacation. \n\n\n\
 n    1. I would like to discuss what I have been doing and what to do next. 
 I am still thinking about the DSL and so on. I will write tomorrow what I ha
 ve (right now it is a dirty document in Spanish/English) and we can discuss 
 about it on Friday. If you cannot make it on Friday\, but you can tomorrow\,
  don't hesitate to schedule a new appointment. \n    2. We also have to disc
 uss what to do with the paper rebuttal from Middleware since it suppose to b
 e next week. \n    3. What to discuss with Rouven? I have some ideas but jus
 t to be sure on the priorities. \n\n\nSee you\, \nInti \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>Meeting with Inti </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organizer:<
 /th><td>"Inti Gonzalez_herrera" &lt\;inti.gonzalez_herrera@irisa.fr&gt\; </t
 d></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Location:</th
 ><td>Skype </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Time:</th><td>Friday\, July 18\, 2
 014\, 4:00:00 PM - 5:30:00 PM GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Pa
 ris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invite
 es:</th><td>johann.bourcier@inria.fr\; olivier.barais@irisa.fr\; inti.glez@i
 risa.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="
 font-family: times new roman\, new york\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; 
 color: #000000"><div style="font-family: times new roman\, new york\, times\
 , serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div style="font-family: times n
 ew roman\, new york\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div
 >Hello\,<br></div><div><br></div><div>Is it possible to meet before your vac
 ation.</div><div><br></div><ol><li>I would like to discuss what I have been 
 doing and what to do next. I am still thinking about the DSL and so on. I wi
 ll write tomorrow what I have (right now it is a dirty document in Spanish/E
 nglish) and we can discuss about it on Friday. If you cannot make it on Frid
 ay\, but you can tomorrow\, don't hesitate to schedule a new appointment.</l
 i><li>We also have to discuss what to do with the paper rebuttal from Middle
 ware since it suppose to be next week.</li><li>What to discuss with Rouven? 
 I have some ideas but just to be sure on the priorities.</li></ol><div><br><
 /div><div><br></div><div>See you\,</div><div>Inti&nbsp\; <br></div></div></d
 iv></div></body></html>
