BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:603e0f26-26da-470d-b09a-65450071c183
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee [Olivier Barais]: Team meeting and hands-on LaTeX
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nBring your laptop and join us on Thursday! \nFirst\
 , we'll get to know the new DiverSE members and chat about the upcoming even
 ts. \nFollowing\, a hands-on session where Olivier Barais will be giving a s
 hort tutorial on discovering the beauty of LaTeX.\nIf you're already familia
 r with LaTeX\, we'd be very glad getting to know the good practices you're f
 ollowing.\nFor those not familiar\, you'll be surprised how amazing it is! \
 nLet's prettify our next research papers.\n\nThe presentation is held in Aur
 igny at 1 pm. \nPlease DO NOT forget to bring your laptop. \n\nKind regards\
 ,\nJuliana.
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Aurigny (D165\, Vidéoprojecteur\, Visioconférence)" <
 rennes-salle_aurigny@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
