BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6048ada4-026f-477b-bd29-449e02cfeb3b
SUMMARY:Discussion SPLC 2013
DESCRIPTION:Hi everyone!\n\n            I'd like to meet you to discuss abou
 t the SPLC 2013 paper. As we've discussed\, it is important to meet to align
  our ideas before we have already some substantial work. It was a bit hard t
 o find this common "hole" in your agendas =) . Benoit\, your presence is rea
 lly important\, this paper is going on a direction that we will need your ex
 pertise on the experimental domain\, so let me know if the schedule does not
  favor you.\n\nBest\,\n\nBosco
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>The following is a new meeting 
 request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Subject:</th><t
 d>Discussion SPLC 2013 </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organiser:</th><td>"Jo
 ao Ferreira_filho" &lt\;joao.ferreira_filho@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</tabl
 e>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Location:</th><td>"Rennes-Sa
 lle Lipari (F202)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; </td>
 </tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Resources:</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)" &l
 t\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202
 )) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Time:</th><td>Thursday\, 20 December\, 201
 2\, 5:00:00 PM - 6:00:00 PM GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Pari
 s\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invitees
 :</th><td>mathieu.acher@irisa.fr\; barais@irisa.fr\; benoit.baudry@inria.fr 
 </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br>Hi everyone!<br><br>
 &nbsp\;           I'd like to meet you to discuss about the SPLC 2013 paper.
  As we've discussed\, it is important to meet to align our ideas before we h
 ave already some substantial work. It was a bit hard to find this common "ho
 le" in your agendas =) . Benoit\, your presence is really important\, this p
 aper is going on a direction that we will need your expertise on the experim
 ental domain\, so let me know if the schedule does not favor you.<br><br>Bes
 t\,<br><br>Bosco</body></html>
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)" <rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inri
 a.fr>
