BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:629c9948-02ab-4d95-833a-5bd8588d3b93
SUMMARY:Point Alif
DESCRIPTION:Hi\, \n\nI meet and discuss with Olivier today and we have a goo
 d story for the paper and plan for the phd thesis. \n\nWe want to separate t
 wo contributions for the phd: \n1. Initial configuration and reconfiguration
 . This is somehow done in my side and we want to submit this to Cloudcom\, o
 r if we miss next week we can try [ https://www.cs.le.ac.uk/events/UCC2020/i
 ndex.htm | UCC ] (deadline is 30 July) \n2. Initial configuration\, reconfig
 \, and perturbation. The general idea is that we consider recovery logic in 
 presence of failures. We want to put recovery logic (load balancing) on the 
 auth server and put perturbation on HLS. For this work\, we target [ https:/
 /icst2021.icmc.usp.br/ | ICST conference ] . \n\nI propose to discuss togeth
 er about the first phd contribution this Friday. The link is just as usual\,
  [ https://rdv1.rendez-vous.renater.fr/alif | https://rdv1.rendez-vous.renat
 er.fr/alif ] \n\nRegards\, \nAlif \n\n\n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>Point Alif </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organizer:</th><td
 >"Alif Akbar Pranata" &lt\;alif-akbar.pranata@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</ta
 ble>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Time:</th><td>Friday\, Jul
 y 10\, 2020\, 3:00:00 PM - 4:00:00 PM GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Mad
 rid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=lef
 t>Invitees:</th><td>olivier.barais@irisa.fr\; johann.bourcier@inria.fr\; lud
 ovic.noirie@nokia-bell-labs.com </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*
 ~*</div><br><div style="font-family: arial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-s
 ize: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>Hi\,</div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div
 ><div>I meet and discuss with Olivier today and we have a good story for the
  paper and plan for the phd thesis.</div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><
 div>We want to separate two contributions for the phd:</div><div>1. Initial 
 configuration and reconfiguration. This is somehow done in my side and we wa
 nt to submit this to Cloudcom\, or if we miss next week we can try <a data-m
 ce-href="https://www.cs.le.ac.uk/events/UCC2020/index.htm" href="https://www
 .cs.le.ac.uk/events/UCC2020/index.htm">UCC</a> (deadline is 30 July)</div><d
 iv>2.&nbsp\;<span style="font-size: 12pt\;">Initial configuration\, reconfig
 \, and perturbation. The general idea is that we consider recovery logic in 
 presence of failures. We want to put recovery logic (load balancing) on the 
 auth server and put perturbation on HLS. For this work\, we target <a data-m
 ce-href="https://icst2021.icmc.usp.br/" href="https://icst2021.icmc.usp.br/"
 >ICST conference</a>.</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt\;"><br d
 ata-mce-bogus="1"></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt\;">I propos
 e to discuss together about the first phd contribution this Friday. The link
  is just as usual\,&nbsp\;</span><a href="https://rdv1.rendez-vous.renater.f
 r/alif" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" style="font-size:
  12pt\;">https://rdv1.rendez-vous.renater.fr/alif</a></div><div><br data-mce
 -bogus="1"></div><div>Regards\,</div><div>Alif</div><div><br data-mce-bogus=
 "1"></div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div></div></body></html>
ATTENDEE;CN=Olivier Barais;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=T
 RUE:mailto:olivier.barais@irisa.fr
