BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:66282b8f-797c-4699-8f54-f698b53bd563
SUMMARY:Farewell - Bosco
DESCRIPTION:Dear Diversians\, \nAfter almost 4 years sharing great moments w
 ith you\, it's time to say goodbye... \n\nI'm very grateful for each of you 
 who helped me so much during my time here. \n\nI really enjoyed working in D
 iverSE\, but let me thank you in person this Thursday\, eating some snacks a
 nd drinking (unfortunately not caipirinha this time)\, 5 pm\, in our beloved
  meeting room Lipari :-) \n\nSee you Thursday \n\nCheers\, \n\nBosco \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>Farewell - Bosco </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organiser:</
 th><td>"Joao bosco Ferreira_filho" &lt\;joao.ferreira_filho@inria.fr&gt\; </
 td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Location:</t
 h><td>"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inr
 ia.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Resources:</th><td>"Rennes-Salle L
 ipari (F202)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (Lieu : Re
 nnes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : orange\, Salle : F202) </td></tr>\n<tr><th ali
 gn=left>Time:</th><td>Thursday\, 30 July\, 2015\, 5:00:00 PM - 7:00:00 PM GM
 T +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<
 table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invitees:</th><td>ren-epi-diverse@zimb
 ra-local.inria.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><d
 iv style="font-family: times new roman\, new york\, times\, serif\; font-siz
 e: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>Dear Diversians\,</div><div>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &
 nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp
 \; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;After almost 4 years sharing great moments with you\, it's
  time to say goodbye...</div><div><br></div><div>I'm very grateful for each 
 of you who helped me so much during my time here.</div><div><br></div><div> 
 I really enjoyed working in DiverSE\, but let me thank you in person this Th
 ursday\, eating some snacks and drinking&nbsp\;<span style="font-size: 12pt\
 ;">(unfortunately not caipirinha this time)\, 5 pm\, in our beloved meeting 
 room Lipari :-) &nbsp\;</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt\;"><br
 ></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt\;">See you Thursday</span></
 div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt\;"><br></span></div><div><span style="
 font-size: 12pt\;">Cheers\,</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt\;"
 ><br></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt\;">Bosco</span></div></d
 iv></body></html>
