SUMMARY:I40 SLR Call
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\,\n\n\n\nas discussed today we’ll now start going through
  the heap. To this end\, we assigned the following chunks of 20 papers each\
 n\n   -          Benoit: Papers 007 – 026\n\n   -          Olivier: Papers 0
 27 – 046\n\n   -          Manuel W: Papers 047 – 066\n\n   -          Manuel
  P (our intern): Papers 067 – 070 (I’ll co-supervise this and hope we can as
 sign more papers next bunch \;))\n\n   -          Andreas W: 071 – 090\n\n\n
 \nThe idea is\, to discuss these papers / our findings Monday\, Apr 16\, 14:
 00 via Skype.\n\n\n\nIs this feasible for you\, Manuel?\n\n\n\nBest\,\n\nAnd
 reas\n
LOCATION:Skype
