BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6B08BC41-CFF5-457A-9F84-71B4CD53BC12
SUMMARY:I40SLR Call
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\,\n\n\n\nuntil the next meeting\, we plan to\n\n   -     
      finish data collection (all)\n\n   -          add ideas of interesting 
 findings as bullets to section 6 (all)\n\n   -          unify our answers to
  the different papers w.r.t. to the specific columns (all)\n\n   -          
 finish updating the SMS (Andreas)\n\n   -          describe the T-like proce
 ss in the introduction (Andreas)\n\n   -          update related work (Manue
 l)\n\n   -          finish the updated SMS research method (Andreas)\n\n   -
           finish the updated SMS findings (Andreas)\n\n         o    draft a
  first version of the SLR research method (Olivier) (I think here\, the revi
 ew protocol is most important - cf https://www.elsevier.com/__data/promis_mi
 sc/525444systematicreviewsguide.pdf)\n\n         o    key items (modulo the 
 SMS information)\n\n               •  Study quality assessment checklists an
 d procedures. The researchers should develop quality checklists to assess th
 e individual studies. The purpose of the quality assessment will guide the d
 evelopment of checklists.\n\n               •  Data extraction strategy. Thi
 s defines how the information required from each primary study will be obtai
 ned. If the data require manipulation or assumptions and inferences to be ma
 de\, the protocol should specify an appropriate validation process.\n\n     
           •  Synthesis of the extracted data. This defines the synthesis str
 ategy. This should clarify whether or not a formal meta-analysis is intended
  and if so what techniques will be used.\n\n   -          think about new th
 reats to validity (Manuel)\n\n   -          think about fitting the DevOps f
 or Industry 4.0 concept into the conclusion (Benoit)\n\n\n\nI hope I caught 
 everything. If not\, please let me know.\n\n\n\nHave a splendid weekend!\n\n
 \n\nBest\,\n\nAndreas\n
LOCATION:Skype (I call)
ATTENDEE;CN=Benoit Combemale;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP
 =TRUE:mailto:benoit.combemale@irisa.fr
ATTENDEE;CN="Wimmer, Manuel";ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP
 =TRUE:mailto:wimmer@big.tuwien.ac.at
ATTENDEE;CN=Olivier Barais;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=DECLINED:mailto:oli
 vier.barais@irisa.fr
PRIORITY:5
