 o connect: <a href=' https://renavisio.renater.fr/user_guide'> https://renav
 isio.renater.fr/user_guide</a> </p>\n\n<p>\n    \n</p>\n\n\n\n<p>\n    Regar
 ds\,<br/>\n    The RENAvisio team</p>\n</body>\n</html>
