BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6d7663fc-e587-410a-bf68-e7f9969638f3
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee Gwendal
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\,\n\nAlmost everything about our next DiverSE coffee is V
 R\, except for our speaker\, Gwendal Le Moulec\, who's 100% real.\n\nGwendal
  will be presenting his latest accepted paper entitled AGENT: Automatic Gene
 ration of ExperimeNtal proTocol runtime.\nIn his approach\, Gwendal proposes
  the use of DSLs to automate the generation of VR experiments. \nThe paper i
 s accepted for publication in the VRST conference\, one of the top-level con
 ferences in VR. \nIf you're interested in more details please check the came
 ra-ready paper enclosed.\n\nEnters Gwendal: \n\n"Due to the nature of Virtua
 l Reality (VR) research\, conducting experiments in order to validate the re
 searcher’s hypotheses is a must. \nHowever\, the development of such experim
 ents is a tedious and time-consuming task. \nIn this work\, we propose to ma
 ke this task easier\, more intuitive and faster with a method able to descri
 be and generate the most tedious components of VR experiments. \nThe main ob
 jective is to let experiment designers focus on their core tasks: designing\
 , conducting\, and reporting experiments.\nTo that end\, we propose the use 
 of Domain-Specific Languages (DSLs) to ease the description and generation o
 f VR experiments.\nAn analysis of published VR experiments is used to identi
 fy the main properties that characterize VR experiments. \nThis allowed us t
 o design AGENT (Automatic Generation of ExperimeNtal proTocol runtime)\, a D
 SL for specifying and generating experimental protocol runtimes. \nWe demons
 trated the feasibility of our approach by using AGENT on two experiments pub
 lished in the VRST’16 proceedings."\n\nThe presentation is held this Thursda
 y in Minquiers room at 1 p.m.\n\nSee you there\, 
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025)" <rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-loca
 l.inria.fr>
ATTENDEE;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:diverse
 @inria.fr
ATTENDEE;CN=Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025);CUTYPE=RESOURCE;ROLE=NON-PARTICIPA
 NT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-loca
 l.inria.fr
ORGANIZER;CN=Amine Benelallam:mailto:amine.benelallam@inria.fr
DTSTART;TZID="Europe/Brussels":20171012T130000
DTEND;TZID="Europe/Brussels":20171012T140000
