SUMMARY:Fresh PhD presentations
DESCRIPTION:Hello\,\n\nThis meeting is meant for all students starting a PhD
  in the group. The goal is for you know to know each other\, what you are do
 ing\, and to get you look\, together\, at what has been done in the team in 
 previous PhD thesis.\n\nTo prepare this meeting\, we would like you to prepa
 re 3-4 slides\, which summarize where you come from\, your background in com
 puter science and the project and research topic you will be investigating d
 uring your PhD.\n\nThanks\,\nBenoit
