BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6eec01d7-c233-4662-8861-7390b31b95c1
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee [Olivier Barais]
DESCRIPTION:Hi All\, \n\nWe'll have Olivier tomorrow in our DiverSE Coffee. 
 \nHe'll share with us all the news from the team and the demos we got. \nAls
 o\, we'll discuss about the way we present the team. \n\nYou can't miss the 
 opportunity to learn more about the team and also help us to prepare a futur
 e roadmap. \nSee you tomorrow in room Aurigny at 1 pm. \n\nKind regards\, \n
 Juliana. \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>DiverSE Coffee [Olivier Barais] </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=le
 ft>Organizer:</th><td>"Juliana Alves pereira" &lt\;juliana.alves-pereira@iri
 sa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left
 >Location:</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Aurigny (D165\, Vidéoprojecteur\, Visioconf
 érence)" &lt\;rennes-salle_aurigny@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n<t
 r><th align=left>Resources:</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Aurigny (D165\, Vidéoproje
 cteur\, Visioconférence)" &lt\;rennes-salle_aurigny@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt
 \; (Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : D\, Étage : orange\, Salle : D165) </td></tr>
 \n<tr><th align=left>Time:</th><td>Thursday\, October 10\, 2019\, 1:00:00 PM
  - 2:00:00 PM GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr>
 </table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invitees:</th><td>dive
 rse@inria.fr\; olivier.barais@irisa.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~
 *~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: arial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\;
  font-size: 11pt\; color: #000000"><div><div>Hi All\,&nbsp\;</div><div><br><
 /div><div>We'll have Olivier tomorrow in our DiverSE Coffee.</div><div>He'll
  share with us all the news from the team and the demos we got.</div><div>Al
 so\, we'll discuss about the way we present the team.&nbsp\;</div><div><br><
 /div><div>You can't miss the opportunity to learn more about the team and al
 so help us to prepare a future roadmap.</div><div>See you tomorrow in room&n
 bsp\;Aurigny at 1 pm.</div><div><br></div><div>Kind regards\,</div><div>Juli
 ana.</div></div></div></body></html>
