BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:72ccd385-3991-44b5-99b4-701a8f89ca72
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee : Gwendal
DESCRIPTION:Hi team\,\n\nThis week\, Gwendal will present on going work abou
 t generation and maintenance of tutorials about DSLs.\n\nThe idea is that fo
 r a DSL to be used\, it needs to be documented.\nIn particular\, they can be
 nefit from documentation by example (i.e.\, tutorials).\nBut producing such 
 documentation is time consuming.\n\nThis presentation aims at retrieving fee
 dbacks over the approach.\nThis is basically to discuss about the idea befor
 e actually rushing into implementation\nand writing activities.\n\nSee you t
 here !\n
