BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:739eeb1c-893b-4ddb-addf-cda018c78e4d
SUMMARY:Diverse Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Please welcome Sophie Ebersold our DiverSE Coffee speaker on Thu
 rsday.\n\nEnters @Sophie: "The objective of this talk is mainly to present m
 y project of french HDR and get feedbacks from the DiverSE team. An HDR can 
 be seen as a synthesis of research works. Their starting point is the issue 
 of multi design models co-existing in complex systems.  We proposed design s
 olutions based on the concept of point of view\, from unified design languag
 e to collaborative and multi DSML design. A point of view can be considered 
 as a partial model of the system and co-habits with several others heterogen
 eous models. My current preoccupation deals with multi requirements models."
 \n\nThe presentation is held this Thursday\, March 14th in room Markov at 1 
 pm.\n\nKind regards\,\nJuliana.\n
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Markov (G105\, Vidéoprojecteur) [R]" <rennes-salle_ma
 rkov@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
