BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:749f4f80-55ce-4956-a940-15833db0b8d3
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee (Antoine Cheron)
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nIn our DiverSE Coffee this week\, Antoine Cheron wi
 ll present his work on a cloud-based framework for eased design\, optimizati
 on\, and simulation of complex computational-science models.\n\nEnters Antoi
 ne: \n \n"We are working with a team at OSUR that is studying the behavior o
 f water propagation into the soil to predict inundations in France for the n
 ext 40 years. \n\nIn collaboration with them\, we are developing a cloud-bas
 ed framework to help scientists design the desired system model\, describe a
 nd optimize its complex behavioral model and visualize simulation results wi
 th live and collaboration capabilities."\n\nThe presentation is held in Minq
 uiers room at 1 p.m.\n\nKind regards\,\n
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025)" <rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-loca
 l.inria.fr>
