BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7649f2c4-d535-475b-a167-4be9ac09247a
SUMMARY:Atelier Kevoree
DESCRIPTION:Hello\, \n\nFor those who are interested in learning Kevoree in 
 practice\, we (mainly Francois \;)) propose to organize a workshop to learn 
 how to use Kevoree. \nThere will be a guided practical session to learn the 
 main concepts. For those interested in more advanced features\, we will also
  provide some kind of on demand feedback. \n\nFor those who intend to partic
 ipate\, please send an email to Francois or me (just to have an approximate 
 number of participants). \n\nBest\, \n\nJohann \n\n\n
LOCATION:Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)
