UID:80fc8cc2-27fb-469f-8bb4-1b419cf43183
SUMMARY:Pot départ Jonathan
DESCRIPTION:Dear all\,\n\nAs some of you know\, I'm leaving Rennes next week
 .\nI invite all of you to the traditional farewell party on Friday afternoon
 \, starting at 5pm in Lipari room\, in order to thank all of you for the yea
 r and a half spend in the team.\n\nSee you tomorrow\,\nJonathan.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>La réunion suivante a été modif
 iée :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><td>Po
 t départ Jonathan </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:</th><td>"Jona
 than Marchand" &lt\;jonathan.yves.marchand@irisa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table
 >\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><td>"Rennes-Sal
 le Lipari (F202)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; </td><
 /tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Ressources :</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)" &
 lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (Rennes-Salle Lipari (F20
 2)) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Vendredi 17 Août 2012\, 17
 :00:00 - 19:00:00 GMT +01:00 Amsterdam\, Berlin\, Berne\, Rome\, Stockholm\,
  Vienne\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>In
 vités:</th><td>triskell@irisa.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~
 *~*</div><br>Dear all\,<br><br>As some of you know\, I'm leaving Rennes next
  week.<br>I invite all of you to the traditional farewell party on Friday af
 ternoon\, starting at 5pm in Lipari room\, in order to thank all of you for 
 the year and a half spend in the team.<br><br>See you tomorrow\,<br>Jonathan
 .</body></html>
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)" <rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inri
 a.fr>
