UID:82d2fc09-2741-4c7e-a44f-a42189346247
SUMMARY:VaryMDE
DESCRIPTION:Could you prepare a talk about the design and implementation of 
 Alf (suresh) and fUML (jonathan)? \nI will start with some generalities abou
 t Kermeta (v2)\; inspired from http://www.combemale.fr/pub/Kermeta-CAMPAM_AO
 M-04_2012-combemale.pdf \n\nBenoit \n\n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>La réunion suivante a été modif
 iée :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><td>Va
 ryMDE </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:</th><td>"Benoit Combemale
 " &lt\;benoit.combemale@irisa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table bord
 er='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><td>Palaiseau [MODIFIÉ]</td></tr>\
 n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Vendredi 15 Juin 2012\, 08:00:00 - 18:00:
 00 GMT +01:00 Bruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n
 <p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>"Benoit Baudry"
  &lt\;bbaudry@irisa.fr&gt\;\; "Suresh Pillay" &lt\;suresh.pillay@irisa.fr&gt
 \;\; "Jonathan Marchand" &lt\;jonathan.yves.marchand@irisa.fr&gt\;\; "Olivie
 r Barais" &lt\;barais@irisa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*
 ~*~*~*</div><br><div style='font-family:times new roman\,new york\,times\,se
 rif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000\;'>Could you prepare a talk about the
  design and implementation of Alf (suresh) and fUML (jonathan)?<br>I will st
 art with some generalities about Kermeta (v2)\; inspired from http://www.com
 bemale.fr/pub/Kermeta-CAMPAM_AOM-04_2012-combemale.pdf<br><br>Benoit<br><div
  style="font-family:times new roman\,new york\,times\,serif\; font-size: 12p
 t\; color: #000000\;"></div></div></body></html>
