SUMMARY:Fresh PhD Seminar
DESCRIPTION:Hi everybody\, \n\nThis week\, we'll have Tam presenting a PhD T
 hesis\, Olivier and Nicolas presenting an article. \nTam will present : \nOl
 ivier will present : "Software Architecture Evolution" \nNicolas will presen
 t : "Essay on Semantics Definition in MDE. An instrumented approach for Mode
 l Verification" \n\nBest\, \nJohann \n\n\n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>Nouvelle demande de réunion ci-
 dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><t
 d>Fresh PhD Seminar </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:</th><td>"Jo
 hann Bourcier" &lt\;johann.bourcier@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\
 n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><td>Salle Lipari </td>
 </tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Lundi 22 Novembre 2010\, 10:00:00 -
  12:00:00 GMT +01:00 Bruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></t
 able>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>"Aymeric
  Hervieu" <aymeric.hervieu@irisa.fr>\; "Clement Guy" <clement.guy@inria.fr>\
 ; "Naouel Moha" <naouel.moha@irisa.fr>\; "Loic Lesage" <loic.lesage@inria.fr
 >\; "Olivier-Nathanael Ben_david" <olivier-nathanael.ben_david@inria.fr>\; "
 Tam Le_nhan" <tam.le_nhan@inria.fr>\; "Nicolas Sannier" <nicolas.sannier@iri
 sa.fr>\; "Mahmoud Ben_hassine" <mahmoud.ben_hassine@inria.fr>\; "Jacques Fal
 cou" <jacques.falcou@inria.fr>\; "Juan-Jose Cadavid_gomez" <juan-jose.cadavi
 d_gomez@inria.fr>\;  ... </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div
 ><br><div style='font-family:Times New Roman\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000
 000\;'>Hi everybody\,<br><br>This week\, we'll have Tam presenting a PhD The
 sis\, Olivier and Nicolas presenting an article.<br>Tam will present : <br>O
 livier will present : "Software Architecture Evolution"<br>Nicolas will pres
 ent : "Essay on Semantics Definition in MDE. An instrumented approach for Mo
 del Verification"<br><br>Best\,<br>Johann<br><br><br></div></body></html>
