BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:85f9e82d-1274-4e88-984a-5b0e28eb1b77
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee: Fabien Coulon
DESCRIPTION:\nEveryone! Please\, welcome ale-lang! An Action Language for EM
 F\, very soon to be integrated in the GEMOC workbench ! \n\nIn the next Dive
 rSE ALE session\, Fabien will present how seamlessly we can wave behavior of
  domain specific languages right from the EcoreTools modeler using ale-lang 
 . \nThis work will be presented at EclipseCon France. For more information\,
  please check the talk's description . \n\nThis The talk is held in Petri ro
 om (G107) at 1 p.m. \n\nFor your own safety\, please leave your car at home\
 , and use public transportation to join the ALE Session! \n\nBe cool & join 
 DiverSE ALE! \n\n\n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>DiverSE Coffee: Fabien Coulon </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left
 >Organiser:</th><td>"Amine Benelallam" &lt\;amine.benelallam@inria.fr&gt\; <
 /td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Time:</th><
 td>Thursday\, 4 May\, 2017\, 1:00:00 PM - 2:00:00 PM GMT +01:00 Brussels\, C
 openhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<t
 r><th align=left>Invitees:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<d
 iv>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: times new roman\, n
 ew york\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div><br></div><
 div>Everyone! Please\, welcome <strong>ale-lang!</strong>&nbsp\; An Action L
 anguage&nbsp\;for EMF\, very soon to be integrated in the <strong>GEMOC work
 bench</strong>!<br></div><div><br></div><div>In the next DiverSE <strong>ALE
 </strong> session\, Fabien will present how seamlessly we can wave&nbsp\;beh
 avior of domain specific languages right from the EcoreTools modeler using <
 a data-mce-href="http://gemoc.org/ale-lang/" href="http://gemoc.org/ale-lang
 /">ale-lang</a>.</div><div>This work will be presented at EclipseCon France.
  For&nbsp\;more information\, please check the&nbsp\;<a data-mce-href="https
 ://www.eclipsecon.org/france2017/session/ecoretools-next-executable-dsl-made
 -more-accessible" href="https://www.eclipsecon.org/france2017/session/ecoret
 ools-next-executable-dsl-made-more-accessible" style="font-size: 12pt\;">tal
 k's&nbsp\;description</a><span style="font-size: 12pt\;">.</span></div><div>
 <br></div><div><span style="font-weight: bold\;" data-mce-style="font-weight
 : bold\;">This&nbsp\;</span><strong style="background-color: #ffffff\;" data
 -mce-style="background-color: #ffffff\;">The talk is held in&nbsp\;Petri&nbs
 p\;room (G107) at 1 p.m.</strong></div><div><strong style="background-color:
  #ffffff\;" data-mce-style="background-color: #ffffff\;"><br></strong></div>
 <div><strong>For your own safety\, please leave your car at home\, and use p
 ublic transportation to join the ALE Session!</strong><br></div><div><br></d
 iv><div><strong>Be cool &amp\; join&nbsp\;DiverSE ALE!</strong></div><div><s
 trong><br></strong></div><div><strong><br></strong></div></div></body></html
 >
ATTENDEE;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:diverse
 @inria.fr
ORGANIZER;CN=Amine Benelallam:mailto:amine.benelallam@inria.fr
