 e would like to present what he has done during his internship tomorrow (Tue
 sday the 28th of june) at 13:30. \nI've booked room Sardaigne (blue level\, 
 F building -> downstairs). \n\nHope to see you there\, \nCheers\, \nPaul \n\
 nPS : no coffees during this presentation... Sadly... :( Sorry :/ \n\n
