 00000"><div>Hello team !<br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div><br></div><div>Thi
 s is the last week of our interns Bruno and Pierre\;<br></div><div>as we won
 't be able to hear Bruno during the coffee this week<br></div><div>he would 
