SUMMARY:CVL Submission Team
DESCRIPTION:Agenda:\n•       Configurable Units semantics: Pseudo code from 
 INRIA (30 min)\n•       Configurable Units encapsulation of derivations etc:
  Discussion (20 min)\n•       Collection of anti-claims (5 min)\n•       AOB
  (5 min)\n\n\n\n\nOystein Haugen invites you to an online meeting using WebE
 x.\n\nMeeting Number: 848 614 939\nMeeting Password: abrakadabra\n\n--------
 -----------------------------------------------\nTo join this meeting (Now f
 rom mobile devices!)\n------------------------------------------------------
 -\n1. Go to https://sintef.webex.com/sintef/j.php?J=848614939&PW=NMGI3MzcyMj
 g3\n2. If requested\, enter your name and email address.\n3. If a password i
 s required\, enter the meeting password: abrakadabra\n4. Click "Join".\n5. F
 ollow the instructions that appear on your screen.\n\n\n\n------------------
 -------------------------------------\nAudio conference information\n-------
