BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8ccaf22b-0548-4bcd-8e62-0cd77a3f72be
SUMMARY:CVL / Scala
DESCRIPTION:Hi Bosco\, \n\nI would like to discuss about an operationalisati
 on of CVL in Scala. \nAs far as I have seen the CVL implementation is too he
 avyweight and impractical. \n\nAn internal DSL seems suited and will be a go
 od exercice for formalizing CVL and our ideas. \nAlso we need it for improvi
 ng the tooling support and for the work with Marianela/Julien. \n\nCould you
  prepare a draft solution ? (not necessarily Scala code that compiles\, but 
 how it could look like) \n\nBest\, \n\nMathieu\n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>Nouvelle demande de réunion ci-
 dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><t
 d>CVL / Scala </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:</th><td>"Mathieu 
 Acher" &lt\;mathieu.acher@irisa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table bo
 rder='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Jeudi 4 Juillet 2013\, 10:00:00
  - 10:30:00 GMT +01:00 Bruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr><
 /table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>joao.f
 erreira_filho@inria.fr\; olivier.barais@irisa.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>
 *~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br>Hi Bosco\, <br><br>I would like to discuss abou
 t an operationalisation of CVL in Scala. <br>As far as I have seen the CVL i
 mplementation is too heavyweight and impractical. <br><br>An internal DSL se
 ems suited and will be a good exercice for formalizing CVL and our ideas. <b
 r>Also we need it for improving the tooling support and for the work with Ma
 rianela/Julien. <br><br>Could you prepare a draft solution ? (not necessaril
 y Scala code that compiles\, but how it could look like) <br><br>Best\, <br>
 <br>Mathieu<br></body></html>
ATTENDEE;CN=Joao Ferreira_filho;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;R
 SVP=TRUE:mailto:joao.ferreira_filho@inria.fr
