 t to have a call of at least four participants in September 19. Hence\, we’l
 l use this slot to discuss\n\n\n\n   (1)     Feedback on the executive summa
 ry\n\n   (2)     The next steps (especially the MODELS18 meeting)\n\n\n\nIf 
 you already have feedback on the draft summary\, please let us know as soon 
 as possible to give us time incorporating that.\n\n\n\n[1] https://doodle.co
 m/poll/v87p8izz6hruqu33\n\n\n\nBest regards\,\n\nAndreas\n
