BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:94ebc9f2-8572-4d19-aaa2-3a493887fe93
SUMMARY:Diverse coffee
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nWe're happy to have Antoine Cheron as a speaker for
  our next DiverSE Coffee.\n\nEnters Antoine: \n"Today\, the web we interact 
 with is mostly composed of two kinds of components: web pages and APIs. As w
 eb pages are full of hyperlinks and hypermedia\, web APIs are not. Though au
 gmenting web APIs with links is at the core of the REST architectural style\
 , and only 5% of APIs do. Yes\, 5%\, even though most people say they provid
 e RESTful APIs. In this talk\, I will show what an API with hyperlinks and h
 ypermedia looks like\, what problems of distributed systems integration and 
 composition it can solve and what it would change in frontend code to have s
 uch APIs. This talk aims at being very accessible. So I will need your feedb
 ack to make it as easy as possible to understand for anyone who has\, or not
 \, a background in computer science."\n\nThe presentation is held in Room Ma
 rkov on Thursday at 1 pm.\n\nRegards\, \n\n----- Original Appointment -----\
 nSubject: Fwd: Diverse coffee \nOrganizer: virginie.desroches@inria.fr \n\nL
 ocation: "Rennes-Salle Markov (G105\, Vidéoprojecteur) [R]" <rennes-salle_ma
 rkov@zimbra-local.inria.fr> \nResources: "Rennes-Salle Markov (G105\, Vidéop
 rojecteur) [R]" <rennes-salle_markov@zimbra-local.inria.fr> (Rennes-Salle Ma
 rkov (G105\, Vidéoprojecteur) [R]) \nTime: Thursday\, November 8\, 2018\, 1:
 00:00 PM - 2:00:00 PM GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n \n
 \n*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*\n\n
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Markov (G105\, Vidéoprojecteur) [R]" <rennes-salle_ma
 rkov@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
ATTENDEE;CN=Antoine Cheron;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:antoine.ch
 eron@fabernovel.com
ATTENDEE;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:diverse@inria.fr
X-MS-OLK-SENDER:mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr
ORGANIZER;CN=Virginie Desroches;SENT-BY="mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.
 fr":mailto:virginie.desroches@inria.fr
X-MS-OLK-SENDER:mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr
