DESCRIPTION:Hi team\, \n\nthis Thursday\, 2 presentations in 1 session ! \n\
 nAntoine will introduce himself to you ! :) \nHe is a ESIR student and will 
 perform an internship with us. \nHe is currently in the office with Johann a
 nd Nicolas (in the very far end of the corridor =) ) \n\nAfter that\, Manuel
  will perform a presentation. \nIt can be considered as a context setting fo
 r his PhD. \nHis talk is called EMF Object Algebras: A new way to tackle the
  expression problem in the modeling wor ld . \n
