BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a00698c9-4813-41c9-ba38-00d91dcad223
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\,\n\nWe're happy to have Oscar tomorrow as our next Diver
 SE Coffee speaker to talk about Inform 7.\n\nEnters @Oscar: Inform 7 is a do
 main specific language to create interactive fiction and textual adventures.
  The language has been designed for writers and content creators rather than
  developers and it mimics natural English. It also comes with a full develop
 ment environment that includes testing utils. In this DiverSE Coffee\, we wi
 ll explore the very basics of Inform 7 by creating a simple game.\n\nAfter O
 scar talk\, we will get to know from the ICSE'19 attendees their experience 
 about being in such a huge premier software-engineering conference. \nLet's 
 also talk about our movements for taking part in ICSE'20 in South Korea.\n\n
 You can't miss the chance to learn more about ICSE and create your own game.
 \nThe talk is held tomorrow in room Turing-Petri at 1 pm. \n\nKind regards\,
 \nJuliana.\n
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Turing-Petri (G109-G107\, Vidéoprojecteur\, Salle sép
 arable en deux) [R]" <rennes-salle_turing-petri@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
ATTENDEE;CN=diverse;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:diverse@inria.fr
ATTENDEE;CN=Oscar Luis Vera perez;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:osc
 ar.vera-perez@inria.fr
