SUMMARY:Writing during the PhD
DESCRIPTION:Hello\, \n\n\n\nAs mentioned during the fall seminar\, writing i
 s an essential part of the PhD\, and this writing activity must be practiced
  according to idiomatic patterns. \nDuring this meeting we'd like to give yo
 u some motivations and pointers about these practices for writing. \n\n\nBen
 oit 
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>La réunion suivante a été modif
 iée :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><td>Wr
 iting during the PhD </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:</th><td>"B
