 able border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><td>Rennes-Salle Sicile (
 F302) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Ressources :</th><td>Rennes-Salle Sicil
 e (F302) (Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : vert\, Salle : F302) </td><
 /tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Mercredi 7 Décembre 2011\, 09:30:00 
 - 10:30:00 GMT +01:00 Belgrade\, Bratislava\, Budapest\, Ljubljana\, Prague\
 n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</
 th><td>"Tam Le_nhan" <tam.le_nhan@inria.fr>\; "emmanuelle Rouille" <emmanuel
 le.rouille@irisa.fr>\; "Clement Guy" <clement.guy@inria.fr>\; "Olivier-Natha
 nael Ben_david" <olivier-nathanael.ben_david@inria.fr>\; "Aymeric Hervieu" <
 aymeric.hervieu@irisa.fr>\; "Nicolas Sannier" <nicolas.sannier@irisa.fr>\; "
 Suresh Pillay" <suresh.pillay@irisa.fr>\; "Joao Ferreira_filho" <joao.ferrei
 ra_filho@inria.fr>\; "Jonathan Marchand" <jonathan.yves.marchand@irisa.fr>\;
  hamza.samih@all4tec.net\;  ... </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*
 ~*</div><br><div style='font-family:Times New Roman\; font-size: 12pt\; colo
 r: #000000\;'>Hello\,<div style="font-family:Times New Roman\; font-size: 12
 pt\; color: #000000\;"></div><div><br></div><div>As mentioned during the fal
 l seminar\, writing is an essential part of the PhD\, and this writing activ
 ity must be practiced according to idiomatic patterns.</div><div>During this
  meeting we'd like to give you some motivations and pointers about these pra
 ctices for writing.</div><div><br></div><div>Benoit</div></div></body></html
 >
