DESCRIPTION:Hi Gerson\,\n\n\n\nThank you\, scheduled.\n\n\n\nRegards\,\nPave
 l\n\nFrom: Gerson Sunyé <gerson.sunye@univ-nantes.fr>\nDate: Monday\, Januar
 y 29\, 2018 at 11:10 AM\nTo: Pavel Kirillov <c-pkirillov@parallels.com>\nCc:
  Massimo Tisi <massimo.tisi@imt-atlantique.fr>\, Olivier Barais <barais@iris
 a.fr>\nSubject: Re: CODER @ICT16\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOn 25 Jan 2018\, at 17:02\
 , Pavel Kirillov <c-pkirillov@parallels.com<mailto:c-pkirillov@parallels.com
 >> wrote:\n\n\n\nHi Gerson\,\n\n\n\nThank you for the email.  I suggest a 45
  min video call on Jan 30\, possible slots are 4 pm / 5 pm / 6 pm CET.  Plea
 se let me know what time works best for you\, and I will set up.\n\n\n\nRega
 rds\,\n\nPavel\n\n\n\nHi Pavel\,\n\n\n\nOlivier and I are both free at 5pm.\
 n\n\n\nRegards\,\n\n\n\nGerson\n\n\n\nHi there\,\n\nPavel Kirillov is inviti
 ng you to a scheduled Zoom meeting.\n\nJoin from PC\, Mac\, Linux\, iOS or A
 ndroid: https://acronis.zoom.us/j/3300285451\n\nOr iPhone one-tap :\nUS: +16
 699006833\,\,3300285451# or +16465588656\,\,3300285451#\nOr Telephone:\nDial
 (for higher quality\, dial a number based on your current location):\nUS: +1
  669 900 6833 or +1 646 558 8656 or +1 877 853 5257 (Toll Free) or +1 855 88
 0 1246 (Toll Free)\nRussia: +7 495 283 9788 or +7 800 100 6938 (Toll Free)\n
 Germany: +49 (0) 30 3080 6188 or +49 800 724 3138 (Toll Free)\nUnited Kingdo
 m: +44 (0) 20 3695 0088 or +44 (0) 80 0031 5717 (Toll Free)\nSingapore: +65 
 3158 7288 or 800 852 6054 (Toll Free)\nFrance: +33 (0) 1 8288 0188 or +33 8 
 0508 2588 (Toll Free)\nJapan: +81 (0) 3 4578 1488 or +81 (0) 800 100 5040 (T
 oll Free)\nSwitzerland: +41 (0) 31 528 0988 or +41 800 002 622 (Toll Free)\n
 Meeting ID: 330 028 5451\nInternational numbers available: https://acronis.z
 oom.us/zoomconference?m=4WFcnwD5XMwYf8fKsbZ0Mjq_eKY_AFU4\n\n\n
