UID:ab3311e4-0ce8-453f-8ba3-1eec577cf5c7
SUMMARY:Brief recap MODELS'17 / OA4MDE
DESCRIPTION:Actions for tomorrow: \n\n- Tijs: Implementation pattern Section
  (Current IV\, and future III) \n- Olivier: Tooling section (Current VI\, an
 d future V) \n- Benoit: Big Picture to give the hand to Thomas\, proofread R
 W\, and propose a first draft of the conclusion \n- Manu: Evaluation section
  \n- Thomas: the rest :) especially 1\, 2 and 3 :) \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>Nouvelle demande 
 de réunion ci-dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>
 Sujet :</th><td>Brief recap MODELS'17 / OA4MDE </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=lef
 t>Organisateur:</th><td>"Benoit Combemale" &lt\;benoit.combemale@irisa.fr&gt
 \; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:<
 /th><td>Jeudi 20 Avril 2017\, 11:00:00 - 12:00:00 GMT -05:00 USA/Canada - Ét
 ats de l'Est\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=le
 ft>Invités:</th><td>storm@cwi.nl\; olivier.barais@irisa.fr\; manuel.leduc@in
 ria.fr\; t.f.degueule@cwi.nl </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*<
 /div><br><div style="font-family: times new roman\, new york\, times\, serif
 \; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>Actions for tomorrow:&nbsp\;</div>
 <div><br></div><div>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;- Tijs: Implementation patte
 rn Section (Current IV\, and future III)</div><div>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbs
 p\;- Olivier: Tooling section (Current VI\, and future V)</div><div>&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;- Benoit: &nbsp\;Big Picture to give the hand to Thomas\
 , proofread RW\, and propose a first draft of the conclusion</div><div>&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;- Manu: Evaluation section</div><div>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;&nbsp\;- Thomas: the rest :) especially 1\, 2 and 3 :)</div></div></bod
 y></html>
