DESCRIPTION:Hi everybody\,\n\nIn today's DiverSE Coffee there will be no pre
 sentation.\nWith Models 2020 and Eclipse Con the team is busy.\n\nIn this co
 ntext\, I propose to the people that are free\, \nto come in Markov room to 
 share idea concerning internship that we can propose\, \nidea of cool projec
 t to propose to students\, or any topic that you want to talk about.\n\nChee
 rs\,\n\n\nGwendal JOUNEAUX
