BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:af443ddc-c3e3-4547-9d63-061266c0af0a
SUMMARY:DiverSE coffee : Kévin
DESCRIPTION:\nThis week Kevin will present the results of a study he has con
 ducted a while ago in the team. \n\n\nThe goal of the study was to understan
 d the type of relations between websites and identity providers\, \nmainly t
 hrough the types of information requested by websites during OAuth2 authoriz
 ation process. \n\n\nHe will present the results and what was the process to
  analyze those. \nHe is currently in the writing process of an article for P
 roceedings on Privacy Enhancing Technology Symposium (PETS). \n\n\n\n\n\nThe
  meeting will be held in room Les Minquiers at 1:00pm \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>La réunion suivan
 te a été modifiée :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Suje
 t :</th><td>DiverSE coffee : Kévin </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisate
 ur:</th><td>"Paul Temple" &lt\;paul.temple@irisa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table
 >\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><td>"Rennes-Sal
 le Minquiers (B025)" &lt\;rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; 
 </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Ressources :</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Minquiers 
 (B025)" &lt\;rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (Rennes-Salle
  Minquiers (B025)) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Jeudi 8 Déc
 embre 2016\, 13:00:00 - 14:00:00 GMT +01:00 Amsterdam\, Berlin\, Berne\, Rom
 e\, Stockholm\, Vienne\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><t
 h align=left>Invités:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~
 *~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: times new roman\, new yo
 rk\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div style="font-fami
 ly: times new roman\, new york\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #0
 00000"><div><p style="margin: 0px\;">This week Kevin will present the result
 s of a study he has conducted a while ago in the&nbsp\; team.</p><p style="m
 argin: 0px\;"><br></p><p style="margin: 0px\;">The goal of the study was to 
 understand the type of relations between websites and identity providers\, <
 /p><p style="margin: 0px\;">mainly through the types of information requeste
 d by websites during OAuth2 authorization process.</p><p style="margin: 0px\
 ;"><br></p><p style="margin: 0px\;">He will present the results and what was
  the process to analyze those.</p><p style="margin: 0px\;">He is currently i
 n the writing process of an article for <span style="font-family: times new 
 roman\,new york\,times\,serif\; font-size: medium\;">Proceedings on Privacy 
 Enhancing Technology Symposium</span> (PETS).<br></p><p style="margin: 0px\;
 "><br></p><p style="margin: 0px\;"><br></p><p style="margin: 0px\;">The meet
 ing will be held in room <strong>Les Minquiers</strong> at 1:00pm</p></div><
 /div></div></body></html>
