 ttps://pad.inria.fr/p/np_82nURNdPcLyfeGvD_gamesSE. Today\, in our DiverSE co
 ffee\, we will synthesize what we have\, discuss what we can add\, and take 
 action points." \n\nThe presentation is held in room Aurigny at 1pm. \n\nKin
 d regards\, \nJuliana. \n
