BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b4405640-b2c3-4d54-bb6c-ce40c122f238
SUMMARY:DiverSE eCoffee [Luc] (Wednesday 20th!)
DESCRIPTION:Hey\, \n\nTLTR: \nDiverSE eCoffee on Wednesday 20th from 1:15 to
  2:30 by Luc on an "Introduction to machine learning". \n\nNext week is real
 ly a special week!! Indeed\, Thursday will be the 21st and a holiday\, thus\
 , we may not work. (Well\, there might be a play on words here...I'll let yo
 u find it. I'll bring a cake (whenever you can all come back to the lab) to 
 the one who finds it first :p) So\, I propose to move the DiverSE eCoffee to
  Wednesday 20th instead. AND it is especially special because it WILL be Luc
 's presentation about an "Introduction to machine learning" !! (It's been mo
 re than 5 months that some of you have been waiting for it! So here it is!) 
 \n\nSee you there\, \nJune \n\n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>Nouvelle demande 
 de réunion ci-dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>
 Sujet :</th><td>DiverSE eCoffee [Luc] (Wednesday 20th!) </td></tr>\n<tr><th 
 align=left>Organisateur:</th><td>"June Benvegnu-Sallou" &lt\;june.benvegnu-s
 allou@irisa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th a
 lign=left>Heure:</th><td>Mercredi 20 Mai 2020\, 13:15:00 - 14:30:00 GMT +01:
 00 Bruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table
  border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr </td></tr
 >\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: aria
 l\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>Hey\,<br
  data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div><div>TLTR:<
 br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>DiverSE eCoffee on Wednesday 20th from 1:15
  to 2:30 by Luc on an "Introduction to machine learning".</div></div><div><b
 r data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>Next week is really a special week!! Indeed\
 , Thursday will be the 21st and a holiday\, thus\, we may not work. (Well\, 
 there might be a play on words here...I'll let you find it. I'll bring a cak
 e (whenever you can all come back to the lab) to the one who finds it first 
 :p) So\, I propose to move the DiverSE eCoffee to <strong>Wednesday 20th</st
 rong> instead. AND it is especially special because it WILL be <strong>Luc's
  presentation about an "Introduction to machine learning"</strong>!! (It's b
 een more than 5 months that some of you have been waiting for it! So here it
  is!)<br></div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>See you there\,<br dat
 a-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>June<br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div><br data-mc
 e-bogus="1"></div></div></body></html>
