BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b4d20070-a588-4ee9-aa49-978c0d055feb
SUMMARY:Xavier's farewell party
DESCRIPTION:Hi everyone\, \n\nAs you know\, my time in the Triskell team is 
 coming to an end. My contract will finish the 30th of June and I will start 
 another postdoc in Strasbourg. \nI invite you friday afternoon for a traditi
 onal farewell party (free food and free drink!) to thank you for the last ye
 ar and a half passed here and to say goodbye. \n\nIt will take place in Lipa
 ri room and will probably start around 17:00 (we can start earlier if some o
 f you want to leave early for weekend\, let me know)\n\nSee you on friday\, 
 \nXavier
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>Nouvelle demande de réunion ci-
 dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><t
 d>Xavier's farewell party </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:</th><
 td>"Xavier Dolques" &lt\;xavier.dolques@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n
 <p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><td>"Rennes-Salle 
 Lipari (F202)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr
 >\n<tr><th align=left>Ressources :</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)" &lt\
 ;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202))
  </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Vendredi 1 Juin 2012\, 16:00:
 00 - 18:00:00 GMT +01:00 Bruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr
 ></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>marc
 o.biazzini@inria.fr\; ivan.paez_anaya@irisa.fr\; erwan.bousse@gmail.com\; an
 tonio-junior.mattos@irisa.fr\; an.phungkhac@inria.fr\; julien.richard-foy@ir
 isa.fr\; joao.ferreira_filho@inria.fr\; suresh.pillay@irisa.fr\; jean-emile.
 dartois@inria.fr\; jonathan.yves.marchand@irisa.fr\; xavier.dolques@inria.fr
  ... </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br>Hi everyone\, <
 br><br>As you know\, my time in the Triskell team is coming to an end. My co
 ntract will finish the 30th of June and I will start another postdoc in Stra
 sbourg. <br>I invite you friday afternoon for a traditional farewell party (
 free food and free drink!) to thank you for the last year and a half passed 
 here and to say goodbye. <br><br>It will take place in Lipari room and will 
 probably start around 17:00 (we can start earlier if some of you want to lea
 ve early for weekend\, let me know)<br><br>See you on friday\, <br>Xavier</b
 ody></html>
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)" <rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inri
 a.fr>
