 g the year she spend with us. \n\nIf you ever wondered what you would look l
 ike if mutation operators were applied on yourself\, \nthis presentation is 
 the place to be ! (except that\, she worked on software source code) \n\nLau
 reline will present the principles of program mutation\, why is it important
  in terms of test and security and finally tools she developed. \n\nThe coff
 ee will stand in room Les Minquiers at 13:00 pm. \n
