BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bb23aabe-befc-4fc5-a350-a00ef551f20f
SUMMARY:DiverSE coffee : Alejandro & Ludovic
DESCRIPTION:Hi team\, \n\nthis week\, again\, we will have 2 presentations. 
 \n\nFirst Ludovic will quickly introduce himself. He will stay with us for o
 ne month and is the new person in the office F225. \n\nThen\, Alejandro will
  finally perform his first presentation in French for us ! And we are glad a
 bout that =) Thank you Alenjandro ! \n\nHis presentation is entitled : Colla
 borative\, distributed mitigation against browser fingerprinting \n\nThe pre
 sentation is about analysis performed in amiunique.org and orange datasets\,
  and the proposal of a new algorithm for fingerprint clustering. \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>La réunion suivan
 te a été modifiée :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Suje
 t :</th><td>DiverSE coffee : Alejandro &amp\; Ludovic </td></tr>\n<tr><th al
 ign=left>Organisateur:</th><td>"Paul Temple" &lt\;paul.temple@irisa.fr&gt\; 
 </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :<
 /th><td>"Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025)" &lt\;rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-l
 ocal.inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Ressources :</th><td>"Renn
 es-Salle Minquiers (B025)" &lt\;rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr
 &gt\; (Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025)) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:<
 /th><td>Jeudi 16 Mars 2017\, 13:00:00 - 14:00:00 GMT +01:00 Amsterdam\, Berl
 in\, Berne\, Rome\, Stockholm\, Vienne\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table bor
 der='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr </td></tr>\n<
 /table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: times ne
 w roman\, new york\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>
 Hi team\,<br></div><div><br></div><div>this week\, again\, we will have 2 pr
 esentations.<br></div><div><br></div><div>First Ludovic will quickly introdu
 ce himself. He will stay with us for one month and is the new person in the 
 office F225.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Then\, Alejandro will finally perf
 orm his first presentation in French for us ! And we are glad about that =) 
 Thank you Alenjandro !<br></div><div><br></div><div>His presentation is enti
 tled : <strong>Collaborative\, distributed mitigation against browser finger
 printing&nbsp\;</strong></div><div><span data-mce-bogus="true"><br></span></
 div><div><span data-mce-bogus="true">The presentation is about analysis perf
 ormed in amiunique.org and orange datasets\, and <span id="result_box" class
 ="short_text" lang="en"><span>the proposal of a new algorithm for fingerprin
 t clustering.</span></span></span></div></div></body></html>
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025)" <rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-loca
 l.inria.fr>
