BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c24ad6d8-581f-444d-a963-b6df4cf15f49
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nTomorrow in our DiverSE Coffee we will have two int
 erns: Philemon Houdaille and Ludovic Richoux.\nThen\, June will lead a discu
 ssion about how we could introduce the DiverSE team for a non-scientist audi
 ence by mean of a 5 minutes video.\n\nEnters @June: "I am taking part in a v
 ideo vulgarisation competition for PhD students organized by the PhD associa
 tion. The goal is to film a 5-minute video about a subject in order to popul
 arize it and make it understandable by everyone (non-scientist and non-resea
 rcher audience). It is the same principle as “my thesis in 180 seconds” but 
 with a 5-minute video. The video will be shown to high school students and t
 he general public next October.\nInstead of making a video about my own PhD 
 subject\, I thought it would be nice to use this opportunity to spread the w
 ord about what the DiverSE team is working on. However\, we have to find the
  subject that would gather most of the work carried out in the team. That’s 
 why I need your creative minds to come with a subject that can be used and o
 n which a script will be written to film the video in August. Thus\, during 
 the second part of the DiverSE Coffee\, by groups\, we will come up with a s
 ubject for the video as a part of us did during the Spring Seminar during th
 e “My thesis in 180 seconds” activity. Some of you have already written down
  some ideas here: http://bit.ly/DiverSEVideo\, that may help us. Be ready to
  blow your mind with great ideas to vulgarise the team research works!"\n\nT
 he talk is held tomorrow in room Markov at 1 pm. \n\nKind regards\,\nJuliana
 .\n
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Markov (G105\, Vidéoprojecteur) [R]" <rennes-salle_ma
 rkov@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
ATTENDEE;CN=diverse;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:diverse@inria.fr
X-MS-OLK-SENDER:mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr
ORGANIZER;CN=Sophie Maupile;SENT-BY="mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr":
 mailto:sophie.maupile@irisa.fr
X-MS-OLK-SENDER:mailto:juliana.alves-pereira@irisa.fr
