UID:c99a05ba-7373-4a8a-b123-7043be2dfce0
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee:  Machine Learning and Software engineering (Presenta
 tion and Panel discussion)
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nAs addressed in my previous email\, we're bringing 
 back to the table the topic " Machine Learning and Software engineering ". \
 n\nIn the agenda\, we have a quick presentation by Johann and Olivier around
  this subject\, followed by a panel discussion about the potential research 
 directions. \n\nThe presentation is held in room Minquiers at 1 p.m. \n\nChe
 ers\, \n\n\n\n\n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>DiverSE Coffee:  Machine Learning and Software engineering (
 Presentation and Panel discussion) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organiser:
 </th><td>"Amine Benelallam" &lt\;amine.benelallam@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n
 </table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Location:</th><td>"Ren
 nes-Salle Minquiers (B025)" &lt\;rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-local.inria.f
 r&gt\; </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Resources:</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Minqu
 iers (B025)" &lt\;rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (Lieu : 
 Rennes\, Bâtiment : B\, Étage : bleu\, Salle : B025) </td></tr>\n<tr><th ali
 gn=left>Time:</th><td>Thursday\, 18 January\, 2018\, 1:00:00 PM - 1:30:00 PM
  GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>
 \n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invitees:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr 
 </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-fam
 ily: times new roman\, new york\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #
 000000"><div>Hi all\,&nbsp\;</div><div><br></div><div>As addressed in my pre
 vious email\, we're bringing back to the table the topic "<strong>Machine Le
 arning and Software engineering</strong>".</div><div><br></div><div>In the a
 genda\, we have a quick presentation by Johann and Olivier around this subje
 ct\, followed by a panel discussion about the potential&nbsp\;research&nbsp\
 ;directions.<br></div><div><br></div><div>The presentation is held in room M
 inquiers at 1 p.m.</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers\,</div><div><br></div><di
 v><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></body></html>
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025)" <rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-loca
 l.inria.fr>
