BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ca36622f-30e7-4359-a58d-1856f01f954a
SUMMARY:Point Alif
DESCRIPTION:Hi\, \n\nI would propose a discussion next Monday afternoon. The
  topic will be a review on the submitted paper to UCC (as Ludovic request) a
 nd the initial results and plans for the next paper for ICST. \n\nPlease let
  me know if you prefer another timing. \n\nRegards\, \nAlif \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>Point Alif </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organizer:</th><td
 >"Alif Akbar Pranata" &lt\;alif-akbar.pranata@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</ta
 ble>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Time:</th><td>Monday\, Sep
 tember 14\, 2020\, 1:30:00 PM - 2:30:00 PM GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\
 , Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th alig
 n=left>Invitees:</th><td>olivier.barais@irisa.fr\; johann.bourcier@inria.fr\
 ; ludovic.noirie@nokia-bell-labs.com </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~
 *~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: arial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; f
 ont-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>Hi\,</div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1">
 </div><div>I would propose a discussion next Monday afternoon. The topic wil
 l be a review on the submitted paper to UCC (as Ludovic request) and the ini
 tial results and plans for the next paper for ICST.</div><div><br data-mce-b
 ogus="1"></div><div>Please let me know if you prefer another timing.</div><d
 iv><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>Regards\,</div><div>Alif</div></div></b
 ody></html>
