SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Hey all\, \n\nThis week\, for the DiverSE Coffee\, we will welco
 me two interns: Aaron and Corentin. They will briefly introduce themselves a
 s well as present the subject of their internship. \n\nBecause we are in a r
 eally particular situation\, this Coffee will also be quite special. Indeed\
 , it will be half virtual for those who are not on campus and half presentia
 l for those who are. For the on-campus part\, the Lipari room is booked. How
 ever\, only less than 8 people can go there. (We'll see if there are more th
 an 8 people present on site.) \n\nFor the virtual part\, the meeting will ta
 ke place through Zoom as usual with this link : \n[ https://univ-tlse2.zoom.
 us/j/4580445850?pwd=cFRjaktQNGVuTklJWElCV0ZuL1JxQT09 | https://univ-tlse2.zo
 om.us/j/4580445850?pwd=cFRjaktQNGVuTklJWElCV0ZuL1JxQT09 ] \nID de réunion: 4
 58 044 5850 \nMot de passe: 121212 \n\nWe will see how it goes (hopefully gr
 eat ahah). \n\nBest\, \nJune \n
