 202" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (Lieu : Rennes\, Bâ
 timent : F\, Étage : orange\, Salle : F202) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>H
 eure:</th><td>Jeudi 25 Juin 2020\, 13:00:00 - 14:00:00 GMT +01:00 Bruxelles\
 , Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\
 n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n
 <div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: arial\, helvetica
 \, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div style="font-family: a
 rial\, helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>Hey a
 ll\,<br></div><div><br></div><div>This week\, for the DiverSE Coffee\, we wi
 ll welcome two interns: Aaron and Corentin. They will briefly introduce them
 selves as well as present the subject of their internship. <br></div><div><b
 r></div><div>Because we are in a really particular situation\, this Coffee w
 ill also be quite special. Indeed\, it will be half virtual for those who ar
 e not on campus and half presential for those who are. For the on-campus par
 t\, the Lipari room is booked. However\, only less than 8 people can go ther
 e. (We'll see if there are more than 8 people present on site.) <br></div><d
 iv><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>For the virtual part\, the meeting will
  take place through Zoom as usual with this link :<br></div><div><a href="ht
 tps://univ-tlse2.zoom.us/j/4580445850?pwd=cFRjaktQNGVuTklJWElCV0ZuL1JxQT09" 
