BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ceb53242-52d1-471a-bd07-5795637d1b08
SUMMARY:Variability management for Cloud Computing
DESCRIPTION:Dear team\, \n\nI would like to do a presentation to the team ab
 out applying of variability management for virtual machine deployment of Pla
 tform as a Service in Cloud Computing environment. This is a part of my PhD 
 work - using MDE for Cloud Computing. In this presentation\, I will talk abo
 ut my problem statement\, expected result\, and my ideas to solve these prob
 lems. I hope that I will have opportunities to collaborate with some of you 
 in this topic. \n\nThank you \n\n\n\n\n\n\n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>The following is a new meeting 
 request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Subject:</th><t
 d>Variability management for Cloud Computing </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>
 Organizer:</th><td>"Tam - Le Nhan" &lt\;tam.le_nhan@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>
 \n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Location:</th><td>Re
 nnes-Salle Lipari (F202) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Resources:</th><td>R
 ennes-Salle Lipari (F202) (Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : orange\, S
 alle : F202) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Time:</th><td>Thursday\, Septemb
 er 15\, 2011\, 4:00:00 PM - 5:00:00 PM GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Ma
 drid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=le
 ft>Invitees:</th><td>"Nicolas Riche" <nicolas.riche@irisa.fr>\; "aymeric" <a
 ymeric.hervieu@irisa.fr>\; "emmanuelle" <emmanuelle.rouille@irisa.fr>\; "nic
 olas" <nicolas.sannier@irisa.fr>\; "clement" <clement.guy@inria.fr>\; "grego
 ry" <gregory.nain@inria.fr>\; "Johann Bourcier" <Johann.Bourcier@inria.fr>\;
  "erwan" <erwan.daubert@inria.fr>\; "Gerson Sunye" <gerson.sunye@inria.fr>\;
  "mickael" <mickael.clavreul@inria.fr>\;  ... </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*
 ~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style='font-family:Times New Roman\; font-siz
 e: 12pt\; color: #000000\;'>Dear team\,<br><br>I&nbsp\; would like to do a p
 resentation to the team about applying of variability management for virtual
  machine deployment of Platform as a Service in Cloud Computing environment.
  This is a part of my PhD work - using MDE for Cloud Computing. In this pres
 entation\, I will talk about my problem statement\, expected result\, and my
  ideas to solve these problems. I hope that I will have opportunities to col
 laborate with some of you in this topic.<br><br>Thank you<br><br><br><br>&nb
 sp\;&nbsp\; <br><br><br></div></body></html>
LOCATION:Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)
