BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d46e8c41-ce85-4acd-9788-42c1895380ef
SUMMARY:DiverSE coffee : plenary session
DESCRIPTION:\nAfter the week at MODELS’16\; all researchers of our team went
  to Paris to present the team to a panel of reviewers/experts/researchers to
  assess the qualities of the team \nand also assess works that DiverSE has p
 roduced.\n\nDuring this coffee\, they will rerun the same presentation (with
  some modifications) as they performed in front of the panel.\n\nWhat you do
  not want to miss are the perspectives of work of the team for the next few 
 years to come.\n\n \n\nThe coffee will be held in room Les Minquiers at 1:00
 pm\n\n(coffee might not be there\; surprise !)
