BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d4bf4401-a4bf-4ac0-9705-31491ef427b5
SUMMARY:[SEMINAR] Formal specification of modular transformation (J. Marchan
 d)
DESCRIPTION:\n\nWe propose in this presentation an example of use of modular
 isation in the formal \nproofs-as-transformation framework. This framework a
 lready allows us to develop model \ntransformations that are correct w.r.t. 
 their specifications\, but modularisation of these \ntransformations is stil
 l in progress. By working on the classical example of UML to relational \nda
 tabases transformation\, we show that modularisation is possible in this fra
 mework. \n\n
LOCATION:Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)
