BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d8f084b0-4249-4ef3-b108-8cca47dee208
SUMMARY:DiverSE coffee : JED
DESCRIPTION:\nDo you think that the blockchain can uberise Uber ? \nJean-Emi
 le will talk about the blockchain this week. \nBlockchain is a shared\, immu
 table ledger for recording the history of transactions. It fosters a new gen
 eration of transactional applications that establish trust\, accountability 
 and transparency with or without third-parties. The blockchain features can 
 provide many opportunities in many areas (finance\, logistic\, energy\, insu
 rance\, etc....) \nThis technology is relying on several paradigms: cryptogr
 aphic algorithms\, a distributed register\, a consensus mechanism\, automati
 c code execution (optional). The are many implementations of the blockchain:
  Bitcoin\, Ethereum\, Hyperledger\, Fabric\, ... \n\nIn this talk\, Jean-Emi
 le will give the key knowledge to understand blockchain mechanisms. Also\, h
 e will provide some insights about the maturity of blockchain technologies. 
 \n\nThe talk will be held in room Pétri \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>La réunion suivan
 te a été modifiée :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Suje
 t :</th><td>DiverSE coffee : JED </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur
 :</th><td>"Paul Temple" &lt\;paul.temple@irisa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\
 n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>Jeudi 6 Avril 20
 17\, 13:00:00 - 14:00:00 GMT +01:00 Amsterdam\, Berlin\, Berne\, Rome\, Stoc
 kholm\, Vienne\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=
 left>Invités:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~
 *~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: times new roman\, new york\, tim
 es\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div style="font-family: time
 s new roman\, new york\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><
 div><p style="margin: 0px\;"><strong>Do you think that the blockchain can ub
 erise Uber ?</strong>&nbsp\;</p><p style="margin: 0px\;">Jean-Emile will tal
 k about the blockchain this week.</p><div>Blockchain is a shared\, immutable
  ledger for recording the history of transactions. It fosters a new generati
 on of transactional applications that establish trust\, accountability and t
 ransparency with or without third-parties. The blockchain features can provi
 de many opportunities in many areas (finance\, logistic\, energy\, insurance
 \, etc....)</div><div>This technology is relying on several paradigms: crypt
 ographic algorithms\, a distributed register\, a consensus mechanism\, autom
 atic code execution (optional). The are many implementations of the blockcha
 in: Bitcoin\, Ethereum\, Hyperledger\, Fabric\, ...&nbsp\;</div><div><br></d
 iv><div>In this talk\, Jean-Emile will give the key knowledge to understand 
 blockchain mechanisms.&nbsp\; Also\, he will provide some insights about the
  maturity of blockchain technologies.</div><div><br></div><div>The talk will
  be held in room <strong>Pétri</strong><br></div><strong></strong></div></di
 v></div></body></html>
ATTENDEE;CN=diverse;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mai
 lto:diverse@inria.fr
ORGANIZER;CN=Paul Temple:mailto:paul.temple@irisa.fr
