BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dbf41b10-fdfc-4dd5-8f70-22a433a9c0a3
SUMMARY:Nicolas' Farewell 
DESCRIPTION:Hello DiverSE\, and some others \;) \n\nIt has been a long journ
 ey for me all along these (almost) 4 years. I'm very grateful for all the pe
 ople I was given the chance to meet\, things I've seen\, places I've been\, 
 work that has been done. \nThough my contract finishes at the end of July\, 
 there are too few people available (and currently too less time for me) to s
 hare a drink to remember this particular period of life we shared in the 12F
  building of the lab. And I'm glad the team will move to the 12E building an
 d the orange level will become a restricted area with a museum to celebrate 
 this great period of time (ok the true story is a bit different\, but let pr
 etend). \n\nSo\, before I move to Luxembourg for another adventure\, I would
  like to invite you all to come and eat/drink/remember/talk/share for an inf
 ormal friendly moment\, before we all move for the crazy ordinary life that 
 will restart the week after. \n\nHave a nice summer (may the weather be with
  you ^^). \n\nCheers\, \nNicolas \n\n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>Nouvelle demande 
 de réunion ci-dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>
 Sujet :</th><td>Nicolas' Farewell  </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisate
 ur:</th><td>"Nicolas Sannier" &lt\;nicolas.sannier@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\
 n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><td>"Re
 nnes-Salle Lipari (F202)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\
 ; </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Ressources :</th><td>"Rennes-Salle Lipari (
 F202)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (Lieu : Rennes\, 
 Bâtiment : F\, Étage : orange\, Salle : F202) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left
 >Heure:</th><td>Vendredi 29 Août 2014\, 17:00:00 - 19:00:00 GMT +01:00 Bruxe
 lles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border=
 '0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr\; clement.g.guy@g
 mail.com\; erwan.daubert@gmail.com\; lydie.mabil@inria.fr\; thomas.genet@iri
 sa.fr\; elisabeth.lebret@inria.fr\; myriam.david@inria.fr </td></tr>\n</tabl
 e>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: times new rom
 an\, new york\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>Hello
  DiverSE\, and some others \;)</div><div><br></div><div>It has been a long j
 ourney for me all along these (almost) 4 years.&nbsp\;I'm very grateful for 
 all the people I was given the chance to meet\, things I've seen\, places I'
 ve been\, work that has been done.</div><div>Though my contract finishes at 
 the end of July\, there are too few people available (and currently too less
  time for me) to share a drink to remember this particular period of life we
  shared in the 12F building of the lab. And I'm glad the team will move to t
 he 12E building and the orange level will become a restricted area with a mu
 seum to celebrate this great period of time (ok the true story is a bit diff
 erent\, but let pretend).</div><div><br></div><div>So\, before I move to Lux
 embourg for another adventure\, I would like to invite you all to come and e
 at/drink/remember/talk/share for an informal friendly moment\, before we all
  move for the crazy ordinary life that will restart the week after.&nbsp\;</
 div><div><br></div><div>Have a nice summer (may the weather be with you ^^).
 </div><div><br></div><div>Cheers\,</div><div>Nicolas</div><div><br></div></d
 iv></body></html>
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)" <rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inri
 a.fr>
ATTENDEE;CN=diverse;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mai
 lto:diverse@inria.fr
