BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e0efbbf0-51de-440c-ac11-695585d01e74
SUMMARY:DiverSE coffee : Johann and Pierre
DESCRIPTION:Hi Team ! \n\nThis week\, Johann Bourcier and Pierre Duros will 
 present cool and funny stuffs about drones. \nThe talk will be divided in tw
 o parts : \n\n- first Pierre will present what he did during his internship 
 with us last summer with drones fleet and computer vision (very nice \;D) \n
 - then Johann will talk about some cool/funny/crazy stuff we can or will be 
 able to do soon with drones and that the world (mostly the USA) is thinking 
 about \n\nThe talk will be held in room Lipari at 1:00pm \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>Nouvelle demande 
 de réunion ci-dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>
 Sujet :</th><td>DiverSE coffee : Johann and Pierre </td></tr>\n<tr><th align
 =left>Organisateur:</th><td>"Paul Temple" &lt\;paul.temple@irisa.fr&gt\; </t
 d></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th
 ><td>"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inri
 a.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Ressources :</th><td>"Rennes-Salle 
 Lipari (F202)" &lt\;rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inria.fr&gt\; (Lieu : R
 ennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : orange\, Salle : F202) </td></tr>\n<tr><th al
 ign=left>Heure:</th><td>Jeudi 24 Novembre 2016\, 13:00:00 - 14:00:00 GMT +01
 :00 Amsterdam\, Berlin\, Berne\, Rome\, Stockholm\, Vienne\n </td></tr></tab
 le>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>diverse@in
 ria.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="f
 ont-family: times new roman\, new york\, times\, serif\; font-size: 12pt\; c
 olor: #000000"><div>Hi Team !<br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div><br></div><di
 v>This week\, Johann Bourcier and Pierre Duros will present cool and funny s
 tuffs about drones.<br></div><div>The talk will be divided in two parts :<br
 ></div><div><br></div><div>- first Pierre will present what he did during hi
 s internship with us last summer with drones fleet and computer vision (very
  nice \;D)<br></div><div>- then Johann will talk about some cool/funny/crazy
  stuff we can or will be able to do soon with drones and that the world (mos
 tly the USA) is thinking about<br></div><div><br></div><div>The talk will be
  held in room <strong>Lipari</strong> at <strong>1:00pm</strong><br></div></
 div></body></html>
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Lipari (F202)" <rennes-salle_lipari@zimbra-local.inri
 a.fr>
