UID:e23b5524-5af7-45c2-97c4-9306abe82c60
SUMMARY:DiverSE coffee : Arnaud
DESCRIPTION:This week Arnaud will present Valeria’s work published at EICS’1
 6 called :\nAutomatic Detection of GUI Design Smells: The Case of Blob Liste
 ner\n\nIn this work\, they focus on GUI controllers and the detection of a n
 ew type of design smell\, called Blob Listener.\n\nResults showed that 21 % 
 of the analyzed GUI controllers are Blob listeners.\n\nThe talk will be held
  in room Les Minquiers
LOCATION:"Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : B\, Étage : bleu\, Salle : B025" <renne
 s-salle_minquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
