BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ea351588-4b5c-48c2-a3c2-1f257a7c0849
SUMMARY:PhD progress report - Le Nhan Tam
DESCRIPTION:\n\nDear all\, \n\n\n\n\nBecause I will back to my country this 
 June\, and I will not join team seminar on 14-15 June\, so I would like to d
 o a presentation for our team about my thesis topic: "Model-Driven Software 
 Engineering for Cloud Computing"\, and introduce about what I am doing\, wha
 t I plan to do\, what are opportunities and challenges related to my thesis.
  And then\, the feedbacks from you are valuable and important for me to impr
 ove my work. \n\nMy presentation will include: \n\n- An introduction to Clou
 d Computing \n\n- My approach for using Model-driven software engineering fo
 r Cloud Computing \n\n\n\n\nThank you \n\nLe Nhan Tam 
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>The following is a new meeting 
 request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Subject:</th><t
 d>PhD progress report - Le Nhan Tam </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organizer
 :</th><td>"Tam - Le Nhan" &lt\;tam.le_nhan@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table
 >\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Location:</th><td>Rennes-Sall
 e Lipari (F202) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Resources:</th><td>Rennes-Sal
 le Lipari (F202) (Lieu : Rennes\, Bâtiment : F\, Étage : orange\, Salle : F2
 02) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Time:</th><td>Thursday\, May 26\, 2011\, 
 2:00:00 PM - 3:00:00 PM GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n 
 </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invitees:</t
 h><td>"Hanen Haouas" <hanen.haouas@inria.fr>\; "Ankur Saini" <ankur.saini@in
 ria.fr>\; "Jonathan Marchand" <jonathan.yves.marchand@irisa.fr>\; "Xavier Do
 lques" <xavier.dolques@inria.fr>\; "Aymeric Hervieu" <aymeric.hervieu@irisa.
 fr>\; "Emmanuelle Rouille" <emmanuelle.rouille@irisa.fr>\; "Nicolas Sannier"
  <nicolas.sannier@irisa.fr>\; "Clement Guy" <clement.guy@inria.fr>\; "Olivie
 r-Nathanael Ben_david" <olivier-nathanael.ben_david@inria.fr>\; "Maha Driss"
  <maha.driss@inria.fr>\;  ... </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*
 </div><br><div style='font-family:Times New Roman\; font-size: 12pt\; color:
  #000000\;'><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html\; charset=UTF
 -8">\n<meta http-equiv="Content-Style-Type" content="text/css">\n<title></ti
 tle>\n<meta name="Generator" content="Cocoa HTML Writer">\n<meta name="Cocoa
 Version" content="1038.35">\n<style type="text/css">\np.p1 {margin: 0.0px 0.
 0px 0.0px 0.0px\; font: 12.0px Helvetica}\np.p2 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0
 .0px\; font: 12.0px Helvetica\; min-height: 14.0px}\nspan.Apple-tab-span {wh
 ite-space:pre}\n</style>\n\n\n<p class="p1">Dear all\,</p>\n<p class="p2"><b
 r></p>\n<p class="p1">Because I will back to my country this June\, and I wi
 ll not join team seminar on 14-15 June\, so I would like to do a presentatio
 n for our team about my thesis topic:&nbsp\; "Model-Driven Software Engineer
 ing for Cloud Computing"\, and introduce about what I am doing\, what I plan
  to do\, what are opportunities and challenges related to my thesis. And the
 n\, the feedbacks from you are valuable and important for me to improve my w
 ork.</p>\n<p class="p1">My presentation will include:</p>\n<p class="p1"><sp
 an class="Apple-tab-span"></span>- An introduction to Cloud Computing&nbsp\;
 </p>\n<p class="p1"><span class="Apple-tab-span"></span>- My approach for us
 ing Model-driven software engineering for Cloud Computing</p>\n<p class="p2"
 ><br></p>\n<p class="p1">Thank you</p>\n<p class="p2">&nbsp\;Le Nhan Tam</p>
 </div></body></html>
