UID:eec80029-7c57-4155-ba7d-c4ef468b7b3f
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;COUNT=6;INTERVAL=2;BYDAY=MO
SUMMARY:Fresh PhD Seminar
DESCRIPTION:Hi everybody\, \n\nWe'll have the first PhD Seminar next week on
  monday. \nFor the first hour\, Aymeric will present freddy's PhD. \nThen Em
 manuelle will present "Modeling Modeling Modeling". \nFinally Nicolas will p
 resent "Achieving Process modeling and Execution through the Combination of 
 Aspect and Model-Driven Engineering Approaches". \n\nSee you on Monday\, \n\
 nJohann \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>Nouvelle demande de réunion ci-
 dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><t
 d>Fresh PhD Seminar </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:</th><td>"Jo
 hann Bourcier" &lt\;johann.bourcier@inria.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\
 n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><td>Lipari </td></tr>\
 n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th><td>10:00:00 - 12:00:00 GMT +01:00 Bruxelles\
 , Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr><tr><th align=left>Récurrence</th>
 <td>: Toutes les 2 semaine(s)\, le : Lundi Fin après 6 occurrence(s) À parti
 r de : 18 Oct 10</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align
 =left>Invités:</th><td>"Emmanuelle Rouille" <emmanuelle.rouille@irisa.fr>\; 
 "Clement Guy" <clement.guy@inria.fr>\; "Naouel Moha" <naouel.moha@irisa.fr>\
 ; "Loic Lesage" <loic.lesage@inria.fr>\; "Olivier-Nathanael Ben_david" <oliv
 ier-nathanael.ben_david@inria.fr>\; "Tam Le_nhan" <tam.le_nhan@inria.fr>\; "
 Nicolas Sannier" <nicolas.sannier@irisa.fr>\; "Mahmoud Ben_hassine" <mahmoud
 .ben_hassine@inria.fr>\; "Jacques Falcou" <jacques.falcou@inria.fr>\; "Juan-
 Jose Cadavid_gomez" <juan-jose.cadavid_gomez@inria.fr>\;  ... </td></tr>\n</
 table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style='font-family:Times New 
 Roman\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000\;'>Hi everybody\,<br><br>We'll have
  the first PhD Seminar next week on monday.<br>For the first hour\, Aymeric 
 will present freddy's PhD.<br>Then Emmanuelle will present "Modeling Modelin
 g Modeling".<br>Finally Nicolas will present "Achieving Process modeling and
  Execution through the Combination of \nAspect and Model-Driven Engineering 
 Approaches".<br><br>See you on Monday\,<br><br>Johann<br></div></body></html
 >
