BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f084fc5b-22e8-41ec-b81c-e4acfcd7c4b5
SUMMARY:[SEMINAR] Bridging the Wisdom of the Crowd and Software Development 
 (M. Monperrus)
DESCRIPTION:The crowd of developers may have a collective knowledge on how t
 o write good software. In this talk\, I will present new contributions that 
 transform this assumption into a claim. In particular\, we have recently sho
 wn that the wisdom of the crowd can improve development environments\, find 
 bugs\, and generate documentation. 
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body><h3>Nouvelle demande de réunion ci-
 dessous :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Sujet :</th><t
 d>[SEMINAR] Bridging the Wisdom of the Crowd and Software Development (M. Mo
 nperrus) </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left>Organisateur:</th><td>"Benoit Combem
 ale" &lt\;benoit.combemale@irisa.fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table b
 order='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Endroit :</th><td>TBD </td></tr>\n<tr><th ali
 gn=left>Heure:</th><td>Mardi 5 Avril 2011\, 11:00:00 - 12:00:00 GMT +01:00 B
 ruxelles\, Copenhague\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table bor
 der='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>triskell@irisa.fr\; triskell-a
 ll@irisa.fr </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div sty
 le='font-family:Times New Roman\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000\;'>The cr
 owd of developers may have a collective knowledge on how to write good softw
 are. In this talk\, I will present new contributions that transform this ass
 umption into a claim. In particular\, we have recently shown that the wisdom
  of the crowd can improve development environments\, find bugs\, and generat
 e documentation.</div></body></html>
LOCATION:TBD
