BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f5cc4887-67ba-43da-b4f9-f1aeee39624f
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee [David Bromberg] : From a Weiserian to an Orwellian w
 orld
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nOur next guest needs no introduction! His body belo
 ngs to the WIDE team\, but his heart is with DiverSE.\n\nEntitled 'From a We
 iserian to an Orwellian world'\, in his presentation\, he'll be taking us on
  an intergalactic journey passing by Vienna Austria @ICDCS'18\, where he'll 
 give us a thorough look at CASCADE\,   a distributed protocol to share appli
 cative sessions among one’s devices. The proactive session handoff algorithm
  takes inspiration from the BitTorrent P2P file sharing protocol while adapt
 ing it to sharing applicative sessions. The next stop will be @PerCom'18\, A
 thens\, Greece\, where he'll introduce Sprinkler\, a decentralized probabili
 stic dissemination protocol that uses a gossip-based learning algorithm to i
 ntelligently propagate session information to devices a user is most likely 
 to use next.\n\n\nThe presentation is held this Thursday in room Minquiers a
 t 1 p.m.\n\nPointers to the research papers behind the presentation:\n\nSpri
 nler: https://hal.inria.fr/hal-01704172\nCASCADE: https://hal.inria.fr/hal-0
 1797548\n\nKind regards
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéoprojecteur )" <rennes-salle_mi
 nquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
ATTENDEE;CN=diverse;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mai
 lto:diverse@inria.fr
ATTENDEE;CN=David Bromberg;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=T
 RUE:mailto:david.bromberg@irisa.fr
ATTENDEE;CN="Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025, Vidéoprojecteur )";CUTYPE=RESOURC
 E;ROLE=NON-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED:mailto:rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbr
 a-local.inria.fr
X-MOZ-LASTACK:20180612T151500Z
X-MOZ-GENERATION:2
ORGANIZER;CN=Amine Benelallam:mailto:amine.benelallam@inria.fr
