SUMMARY:Need you for 5 minutes for a test
DESCRIPTION:Hi everyone\, \n\nI want to test a service to make conf calls an
 d to check if works properly with at least 20 people. \n\nSo it would be gre
 at if you can connect tomorrow at 10:30. \n\nThe URL to connect is : [ https
 ://framatalk.org/stamp | https://framatalk.org/stamp ] \n\nYou can also conn
 ect from a phone using the application Jitsi meet . In this case: \n- in the
  Parameters\, change the server URL to https://framatalk.org \n- room name: 
 stamp \n\nThanks ! :-) \nCaroline \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>La réunion suivan
 te a été modifiée :</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Suje
 t :</th><td>Need you for 5 minutes for a test </td></tr>\n<tr><th align=left
 >Organisateur:</th><td>"Caroline Landry" &lt\;caroline.landry@inria.fr&gt\; 
 </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Heure:</th
 ><td>Mercredi 13 Mars 2019\, 10:30:00 - 10:45:00 GMT +01:00 Bruxelles\, Cope
 nhague\, Madrid\, Paris [MODIFIÉ]\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table border='
 0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invités:</th><td>diverse@inria.fr </td></tr>\n</tabl
 e>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: trebuchet ms\
 ,sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div style="font-family: tre
 buchet ms\,sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div><div>Hi every
 one\,<br></div><div><br></div><div>I want to test a service to make conf cal
 ls and to check if works properly with at least 20 people.<br></div><div><br
 ></div><div>So it would be great if you can connect tomorrow at 10:30.<br></
 div><div><br></div><div>The URL to connect is : <a href="https://framatalk.o
 rg/stamp" target="_blank">https://framatalk.org/stamp</a><br></div><div><br>
 </div><div>You can also connect from a phone using the application <span sty
 le="color: rgb(0\, 0\, 255)\;">Jitsi meet</span>. In this case:<br></div><di
 v>- in the Parameters\, change the server URL to https://framatalk.org<br></
 div><div>- room name: stamp<br></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks ! :-)<br></d
 iv>Caroline</div></div></div></body></html>
