BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f8d6e9a4-4cdd-472f-a0f2-77a90482e192
SUMMARY:DiverSE Coffee [Guillaume Bécan]: The transfer of innovation\, oppor
 tunities and challenges
DESCRIPTION:The following meeting has been modified:\n\nSubject: DiverSE Cof
 fee [Guillaume Bécan]: The transfer of innovation\, opportunities and challe
 nges \nOrganiser: "Amine Benelallam" <amine.benelallam@inria.fr> \n\nLocatio
 n: "Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéoprojecteur )" <rennes-salle_minquier
 s@zimbra-local.inria.fr> \nResources: "Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéop
 rojecteur )" <rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr> (Rennes-Salle Mi
 nquiers (B025\, Vidéoprojecteur )) \nTime: Thursday\, 5 July\, 2018\, 13:00:
 00 - 15:00:00 GMT +01:00 Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n \nInvitees
 : guillaume.becan@gmail.com\; diverse@inria.fr\; manuel.leduc@inria.fr\; car
 oline.landry@inria.fr \n\n\n*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*\n\nThe following meeting has
  been modified:\n\nSubject: DiverSE Coffee [Guillaume Bécan]: The transfer o
 f innovation\, opportunities and challenges [MODIFIED]\nOrganiser: "Amine Be
 nelallam" <amine.benelallam@inria.fr> \n\nLocation: "Rennes-Salle Minquiers 
 (B025\, Vidéoprojecteur )" <rennes-salle_minquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr> \n
 Resources: "Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéoprojecteur )" <rennes-salle_
 minquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr> (Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéoprojec
 teur )) \nTime: Thursday\, 5 July\, 2018\, 13:00:00 - 14:00:00 GMT +01:00 Br
 ussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n \nInvitees: guillaume.becan@gmail.com
 \; diverse@inria.fr \n\n\n*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*\n\nHi all\, \n\nFor our next D
 iverSE Coffee\, and perhaps the last for this season\, we're glad to welcome
  back to the playing field\, Guillaume Becan\, a team veteran.\n\nGuillaume 
 was doing his Ph.D. under the supervision of Benoit Baudry and Mathieu Acher
 .\nHe was working in reverse engineering of variability models with a focus 
 on product comparison matrices that abound on the web (e.g. in Wikipedia). \
 n \nEnters Guillaume:''\nAfter my Ph.D. at the DiverSE team\, I joined the s
 tartup Mediego which was created in 2015 by Anne-Marie Kermarrec (senior res
 earcher at Inria - Rennes).\nMediego develops a SaaS solution around recomme
 nder systems that enable the personalization of web pages\, newsletters\, an
 d mobile apps.\nIn my talk\, I will present the underlying algorithms and in
 frastructure of Mediego. Then\, I will focus on the challenges we've faced s
 hipping out a recommender system from the Lab to the "real world".''\n\nThe 
 talk is held in Minquiers this Thursday at 1 pm.\n\nKind regards\,
LOCATION:"Rennes-Salle Minquiers (B025\, Vidéoprojecteur )" <rennes-salle_mi
 nquiers@zimbra-local.inria.fr>
