UID:fbfcb726-ddc6-4faa-895e-c6a69810aa85
SUMMARY:Paper update & discussion alif
DESCRIPTION:Hi all\, \n\nI made a major revision to the paper: \n- Revising 
 introduction \n- Writing hypothesis for the research question (section 2.C) 
 \n- Separating baseline and reconfiguration scheme in figure 2 \n- Big revis
 ion in results: Adding validation to the PCA result (in figure 6) using eucl
 idean distance\, summary of reconfiguration scenario pattern (at the end of 
 result section) \n- and other minor revisions on the text and figures. \n\nI
  propose to have meeting online next Tuesday at 2PM to discuss the paper upd
 ate. \n\nSharelatex: [ https://sharelatex.irisa.fr/6682828281jkrqhkzhsnxf | 
 https://sharelatex.irisa.fr/6682828281jkrqhkzhsnxf ] \n\nRegards\, \nAlif \n
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body id='htmlmode'><h3>The following is 
 a new meeting request:</h3>\n\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>S
 ubject:</th><td>Paper update &amp\; discussion alif </td></tr>\n<tr><th alig
 n=left>Organizer:</th><td>"Alif Akbar Pranata" &lt\;alif-akbar.pranata@inria
 .fr&gt\; </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>\n<table border='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>T
 ime:</th><td>Tuesday\, August 25\, 2020\, 2:00:00 PM - 3:00:00 PM GMT +01:00
  Brussels\, Copenhagen\, Madrid\, Paris\n </td></tr></table>\n<p>\n<table bo
 rder='0'>\n<tr><th align=left>Invitees:</th><td>olivier.barais@irisa.fr\; jo
 hann.bourcier@inria.fr\; ludovic.noirie@nokia-bell-labs.com </td></tr>\n</ta
 ble>\n<div>*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*</div><br><div style="font-family: arial\, hel
 vetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: #000000"><div>Hi all\,</div><
 div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>I made a major revision to the paper:<
 /div><div>- Revising introduction</div><div>- Writing hypothesis for the res
 earch question (section 2.C)</div><div>- Separating baseline and reconfigura
 tion scheme in figure 2</div><div>- Big revision in results: Adding validati
 on to the PCA result (in figure 6) using euclidean distance\, summary of rec
 onfiguration scenario pattern (at the end of result section)</div><div>- and
  other minor revisions on the text and figures.</div><div><br data-mce-bogus
 ="1"></div><div>I propose to have meeting online next Tuesday at 2PM to disc
 uss the paper update.</div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>Sharelatex
 :&nbsp\;<a href="https://sharelatex.irisa.fr/6682828281jkrqhkzhsnxf" target=
 "_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: 12pt\; color: 
 darkblue\; text-decoration-line: none\; cursor: pointer\; background-color: 
 rgb(253\, 253\, 253)\;">https://sharelatex.irisa.fr/6682828281jkrqhkzhsnxf</
 a><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div><br data-mce-bogus="1"></div><div>Regard
 s\,</div><div>Alif</div></div></body></html>
