DESCRIPTION:Hey all\, \n\nThere is no presentation planned this week but the
  DiverSE Coffee session is maintained to keep an opportunity for the team me
 mbers to share the team's news (if any) and talk with each other. It may als
 o become an improvised hackathon session (for Dungeons catchphrase CI ?). \n
 Note that it will start at 1pm! :) \n\nThe link (thanks Benoit): \n\n[ https
 ://univ-tlse2.zoom.us/j/4580445850?pwd=cFRjaktQNGVuTklJWElCV0ZuL1JxQT09 | ht
 tps://univ-tlse2.zoom.us/j/4580445850?pwd=cFRjaktQNGVuTklJWElCV0ZuL1JxQT09 ]
  ID : 458 044 5850\nPassword : 121212 \n\nBest\, \nJune \n
