BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:UGxhbm5pbmdfMTcyMzYy
SUMMARY:Customize your own Online IDE with a Devfile
DESCRIPTION:Eclipse Che is an online IDE running in the cloud that can use V
 S Code extensions. In this session\, attendees will learn the following:  - 
 What is Devfile and how do you use it  - How to create a fully functional de
 vfile. As an example I'll show how to prepare an environment to develop Quar
 kus applications in Eclipse Che\, but it can be easily done for different la
 nguages and tools in the same way  - How to setup a developer environment by
  using that devfile  - What are the benefits that they can have using devfil
 es     \n------------\nManage your program here:\nhttps://eclipsecon.app.swa
