BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:UGxhbm5pbmdfMTcyNDEy
SUMMARY:Introducing Open Harmony OS
DESCRIPTION:This session shall explore the current trends in the consumer el
 ectronics market.   We shall identify problems in the current market in term
 s of the fragmentation caused by Dominant vendors led initiatives.  To solve
  the problem we introduce characteristics required of a possible unifying o.
 s. We propose a redifinition of software development targeting real life use
  cases that leverage multiple devices. Harmony OS aims to deliver a unique u
 ser experience across different devices and scenarios which we shall examine
  in this session.                   \n------------\nManage your program here
 :\nhttps://eclipsecon.app.swapcard.com/event/eclipsecon-2020/my-visit/my-sch
 edule
